<!doctype lake><title>𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐫𝐚 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭-𝐈</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><meta name="autoSpacing" content="1" /><h1 data-lake-id="ghZ6T" id="ghZ6T" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u791fd0b0" id="u791fd0b0">🐼</span><span data-lake-id="u84156676" id="u84156676"> 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐚𝐥 𝐁𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧 𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u9110c988" id="u9110c988"><strong><span data-lake-id="u08e30db6" id="u08e30db6">模型压缩中最常见的两类方法是剪枝与量化：剪枝通过将部分神经网络权重置零来移除这些权重，量化则通过降低神经网络权重与激活在存储和计算过程中所采用的数值精度来减少资源开销</span></strong></p><ul list="u877b247f"><li fid="u96535995" data-lake-id="uf507a41e" id="uf507a41e"><span data-lake-id="ufc8b6af3" id="ufc8b6af3">围绕这两类方法，研究界已经提出并分析数百种方案，其总体目标是在尽可能提高压缩率的同时，获得能够保持原有准确率的高效深度神经网络版本</span></li><li fid="u96535995" data-lake-id="ub9d233d3" id="ub9d233d3"><span data-lake-id="u8379b3ea" id="u8379b3ea">尽管该领域已经取得显著进展，模型压缩仍然是一个较为繁琐的过程：剪枝和量化通常彼此独立地进行，而压缩后模型精度的恢复往往还需要对压缩模型进行部分甚至完整的重新训练</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8262a42d" id="u8262a42d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueba4e779" id="ueba4e779" style="color: #DF2A3F">一种更具挑战性的替代场景是训练后压缩。在这种设定下，仅拥有一个已经训练完成但尚未压缩的模型，以及少量校准数据，并需要在不进行重新训练、且计算成本受限的条件下，通过一次压缩过程直接生成具有较高准确率的压缩模型</span></strong></p><ul list="u4466f6aa"><li fid="u1fed8657" data-lake-id="ub4c9ba08" id="ub4c9ba08"><span data-lake-id="u632a4afc" id="u632a4afc">OBS 利用二阶曲率与参数耦合关系评估权重删除后的最小可补偿损失，较幅值剪枝具有更准确的敏感度刻画。后续方法借助 Hessian 或 Fisher 信息近似将其扩展到现代网络规模，但通常依赖渐进式剪枝和充分微调，因而难以满足少量校准数据、无重新训练的严格训练后压缩条件</span></li><li fid="u1fed8657" data-lake-id="u20089861" id="u20089861"><strong><span data-lake-id="u22c9a777" id="u22c9a777" style="color: #000000">逐层重构为该场景提供更适合的建模方式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc85bc6fe" id="uc85bc6fe" style="color: #000000">：依据校准数据保持各层输入输出映射，将剪枝和量化统一为带不同离散约束的局部逼近问题。量化要求权重落入低比特网格，剪枝要求部分权重固定为零，二者可以共享误差度量与补偿机制。这种统一既提高压缩流程的可组合性，也契合 CPU 和 GPU 对稀疏、低比特格式的联合支持，为复合压缩与实际加速提供算法和硬件基础</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u303659b7" id="u303659b7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u674815c6" id="u674815c6" style="color: #5C0036">提出一种统一处理剪枝与量化的数学压缩框架，并在具有挑战性的训练后压缩场景中取得领先的准确率—压缩率权衡。该框架从前述逐层压缩问题出发：无论全局压缩任务采用剪枝还是量化，首先都依据各层在校准数据上的行为，将其分解为一系列逐层子问题</span></strong></p><ul list="ue60ca71a"><li fid="u75d03275" data-lake-id="u0dc5c2d9" id="u0dc5c2d9"><span data-lake-id="u97579337" id="u97579337">对于由权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20W_%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc72686b75bc78b90851cacc8f0ee8f2e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lQIFo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18173cfd" id="u18173cfd">定义、输入为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f669baee60024963b6e4c85058f2bdf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jolzp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u469fbf10" id="u469fbf10">的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf4d12d34c64efce92a74003593d82e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ayr3d%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubbc8aa82" id="ubbc8aa82">层，希望在对压缩权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20W_%5C%5Cell%5Ec%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F32fcb212c6286bfbfa64e0fe21d81a08.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z0B2E%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u593976ca" id="u593976ca">施加</span><strong><span data-lake-id="udbea6801" id="udbea6801">固定压缩约束的条件</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufb57093b" id="ufb57093b">下，找到一个压缩后的权重版本，使其相对于原始未压缩层的输出差异最小。该差异通过原始层与压缩层作用于校准输入后的平方误差</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5ClVert%20W_%5C%5Cell%20X_%5C%5Cell-W_%5C%5Cell%5EcX_%5C%5Cell%5C%5CrVert_2%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3437595d2d0673cc76fd64c8f93324aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hZihY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf994b8da" id="uf994b8da">来衡量</span></li><li fid="u75d03275" data-lake-id="udc5ef3f5" id="udc5ef3f5"><span data-lake-id="uf2a06d39" id="uf2a06d39">尽管在稀疏约束或量化约束下全局最优地求解这一问题属于 NP-hard 问题，但它构成当前先进训练后压缩方法的核心步骤。在逐层求解之后，可以通过组合各层的压缩结果构造完整模型的压缩方案；这种处理方式尤其适合非均匀压缩，因为不同层可以采用不同的压缩强度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uef52ac51" id="uef52ac51"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufa00a011" id="ufa00a011" style="color: #004347">逐层压缩问题的求解质量仍有显著提升空间。总体而言，作者将 OBS 框架专门应用于上述平方误差目标。由于该目标具有严格的二次结构，OBS 理论上可以产生精确的逐步贪心解；然而，直接实现需要四次方量级的计算成本，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa6a72c8dfd6d38dcc696da3b5bd22988.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yqWpy%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud818693c" id="ud818693c" style="color: #004347">表示该层的参数维度，因此难以应用于现代神经网络</span></strong></p><ul list="u4ab3331f"><li fid="u4bf7262e" data-lake-id="u38a39a2b" id="u38a39a2b"><span data-lake-id="u48d30108" id="u48d30108">主要技术贡献是一系列不引入额外近似的高效算法，它们将总体计算成本降低为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(d%5C%5Ccdot%20d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53f1f1a38df505015777864b21601a56.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OGppW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue2b9bfc6" id="ue2b9bfc6">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F506403b90a368af049ed1bbcb8678a93.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H1v4Q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6b142bf9" id="u6b142bf9">是权重矩阵的列维度。借助这些改进，能够在单张 GPU 上、合理时间内，对包含数千万参数的现代深度神经网络精确执行 OBS 的贪心过程：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7d4c3d35" id="u7d4c3d35">算法每次只剪除一个权重，并在每一步之后更新全部相关的剩余权重</span></strong></li><li fid="u4bf7262e" data-lake-id="u700cc54b" id="u700cc54b"><span data-lake-id="ud88316fb" id="ud88316fb">OBQ 根据不同权重量化后对损失增长的影响，逐次选择并量化一个权重；随后利用闭式解更新其余尚未量化的权重，以进一步补偿量化误差并降低损失</span></li><li fid="u4bf7262e" data-lake-id="uaa73659b" id="uaa73659b"><span data-lake-id="u1a413075" id="u1a413075">通过这种方式，剪枝与量化得以在同一</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3314be4" id="ua3314be4">二阶优化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u98c2752b" id="u98c2752b">框架下被高效、统一地处理，作者将这一统一框架称为 Optimal Brain Compressor，即 OBC</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="TKtDn" id="TKtDn" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9e274b2a" id="u9e274b2a">🦊</span><span data-lake-id="u017cc3a3" id="u017cc3a3"> 𝐑𝐞𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue8671c65" id="ue8671c65"><strong><span data-lake-id="u12194d53" id="u12194d53" style="color: #70000D">在逐层压缩框架下，以精确二阶优化替代固定 Hessian、幅值启发式或梯度近似，同时保持各层压缩结果相互独立</span></strong></p><ul list="u438af33f"><li fid="u27910f85" data-lake-id="ubf0a3e3a" id="ubf0a3e3a"><span data-lake-id="u0218b5ca" id="u0218b5ca">在 OBS 相关工作中，经典 OBS 依赖完整二阶信息，最初只能处理极小规模网络。WoodFisher 等方法通过块对角 Fisher 近似和逆 Fisher 高效计算，将其扩展到深度网络；L-OBS 进一步把 OBS 应用于逐层二次损失，但只计算一次 Hessian，并据此完成后续全部剪枝。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9d43d9d" id="ud9d43d9d">OBC 同样采用逐层 OBS，却在每次删除一个权重后重新更新当前二阶问题和剩余权重，因此获得更准确的贪心剪枝轨迹</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6eaf2d8a" id="u6eaf2d8a">​</span></li><li fid="u27910f85" data-lake-id="ub9a3eae8" id="ub9a3eae8"><span data-lake-id="u4c595e51" id="u4c595e51">在训练后量化方面，AdaRound、AdaQuant 和 BRECQ 代表逐层重构路线。AdaRound 优化权重的舍入方向，AdaQuant 允许浮点权重在量化优化过程中继续调整，BRECQ 则引入二阶敏感性并联合优化相关层块。这些方法通常按网络顺序逐层量化，使后续层吸收前层累积误差，精度较高，但层与层之间形成依赖关系；一旦修改某层位宽，后续过程可能需要重新执行。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u23a452c3" id="u23a452c3">OBC 强调每层独立压缩，使不同层的候选结果可以直接组合，并通过校正 BatchNorm 等统计量缩小与顺序方法之间的差距</span></strong></li><li fid="u27910f85" data-lake-id="u1248ec35" id="u1248ec35"><span data-lake-id="uc2b0b2c8" id="uc2b0b2c8">在训练后稀疏化方面，AdaPrune 先依据权重幅值生成剪枝模式，再重新优化剩余权重以恢复层输出。后续研究表明，剪枝与重优化交替得越频繁，效果通常越好。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1e4ca9f2" id="u1e4ca9f2">OBC 将这一思想推进到最细粒度：每删除一个权重便立即对剩余权重进行完整闭式补偿，同时使用包含二阶信息的选择指标，综合评估权重幅值、输入相关性与可补偿性</span></strong></li><li fid="u27910f85" data-lake-id="ua666d49e" id="ua666d49e"><span data-lake-id="u4af01fdd" id="u4af01fdd">非均匀压缩部分关注如何在延迟、能耗或模型大小预算下为不同层分配不同压缩强度。现有方法分为搜索式和求解器式两类：前者通过强化学习或遗传算法探索逐层配置，后者先构造可求解的松弛问题，再用动态规划等方法选择全局组合。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u79b11975" id="u79b11975">OBC 更适合求解器路线，因为每层都能独立生成多种高质量候选结果；当资源预算或目标硬件变化时，只需重新组合候选配置，无需重新执行整个压缩流程</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="bCls8" id="bCls8" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u0191b7be" id="u0191b7be">🦁</span><span data-lake-id="u5b2a00ce" id="u5b2a00ce"> 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐛𝐥𝐞𝐦 𝐃𝐞𝐟𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐁𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ubb9736b6" id="ubb9736b6"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub0ada997" id="ub0ada997">逐层压缩问题：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u34fd16d6" id="u34fd16d6">对于第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F08843ad184698b2d78d7a39e060b9574.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jcdny%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ude51bb7f" id="ude51bb7f">层，将其表示为作用于输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f669baee60024963b6e4c85058f2bdf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MlEP1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41828ae9" id="u41828ae9">、由权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20W_%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc72686b75bc78b90851cacc8f0ee8f2e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s0rUl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u15bf7c1f" id="u15bf7c1f">参数化的函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20f_%5C%5Cell(X_%5C%5Cell%2CW_%5C%5Cell)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F59d6b33e1fa5464beaf4cb95a97426f5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yTXmP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue3b7555c" id="ue3b7555c">。逐层压缩的目标是寻找压缩权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W_%5C%5Cell%5Ec%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1a162d3b2279de81f99cd8413af7ab0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ENj7q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8f20e67a" id="u8f20e67a">，使压缩层与原始层的输出尽可能接近，同时满足相应的压缩约束</span></p><p data-lake-id="uaf799930" id="uaf799930" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7BW_%5C%5Cell%5Ec%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7BX_%5C%5Cell%7D%20L%5C%5Cbigl(f_%5C%5Cell(X_%5C%5Cell%2CW_%5C%5Cell)%2Cf_%5C%5Cell(X_%5C%5Cell%2CW_%5C%5Cell%5Ec)%5C%5Cbigr)%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsubject%20to%20%7D%20C(W_%5C%5Cell%5Ec)%3EC.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe1191c6b5c9e14de2e4735129736a77e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22weK3R%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u82a81b19"><li fid="uee7fa373" data-lake-id="u3c1f5323" id="u3c1f5323"><span data-lake-id="uae738463" id="uae738463">对层输入的期望通常使用少量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QzmZQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5719330a" id="u5719330a">个校准样本的平均值近似。现有工作主要压缩线性层和可展开为线性形式的卷积层，并采用平方损失衡量近似误差。本文遵循这一设定，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W_%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd28804e7dd9149983c8df5ee47f2c7bd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XtdMd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u43b1fca3" id="u43b1fca3">为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brow%7D%7D%5C%5Ctimes%20d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8dd262d37ba5910ddbb01334399ce95.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eftpy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf119dfe" id="ubf119dfe">的权重矩阵，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F151da7b5f71010a1f0a3610234f8adb8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VJha5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uea83e936" id="uea83e936">的维度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5C%5Ctimes%20N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a9e960ce44a7a8cbe22f3f3a3caa752.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w9kSU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u600df824" id="u600df824">，对应问题为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uba3b0a8b" id="uba3b0a8b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7BW_%5C%5Cell%5Ec%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20W_%5C%5Cell%20X_%5C%5Cell-W_%5C%5Cell%5EcX_%5C%5Cell%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%20%7D%20C(W_%5C%5Cell%5Ec)%3EC.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd6188374f46338c0538a5159c024f2e6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yRNRo%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uda487426" id="uda487426"><strong><span data-lake-id="u14f411ab" id="u14f411ab">Optimal Brain Surgeon 框架：OBS用于准确剪枝已经训练完成的稠密神经网络。它从当前参数点处的 Taylor 近似出发，并假设该点的梯度可以忽略，从而给出应删除的单个权重以及补偿该删除操作的剩余权重更新</span></strong></p><ul list="ub29fadb3"><li fid="uf72cfb01" data-lake-id="u263aede6" id="u263aede6"><span data-lake-id="u60c9e1a5" id="u60c9e1a5">设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff1b78684db901dd0b7bfa173991deab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XtIxw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uff612d30" id="uff612d30">为当前稠密模型损失的 Hessian，则造成最小损失增长的待剪权重及对应更新为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u37b85fb3" id="u37b85fb3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_p%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7Bw_p%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bw_p%5E2%7D%7B%5BH%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7Bpp%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cdelta_p%20%3D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bw_p%7D%7B%5BH%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7Bpp%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20H%5E%7B-1%7D_%7B%3A%2Cp%7D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F14b1295ce3d56f33cb3c71d8c4ca640c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S2pqG%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ueaa5e4fd"><li fid="u992999cc" data-lake-id="uf15fa3d8" id="uf15fa3d8"><span data-lake-id="ude092de2" id="ude092de2">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5BH%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7Bpp%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a42de3437680e3d446a80ec68e3bd8c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j3A9s%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6f95932" id="ud6f95932">表示逆 Hessian 的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4cd21d60552e207f237e82def9029b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c4dJT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u72cdd17d" id="u72cdd17d">个对角元素，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5E%7B-1%7D_%7B%3A%2Cp%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1505dd1869e9be8579877e99e05e96b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zy3bS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21fce9a9" id="u21fce9a9">表示其第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4cd21d60552e207f237e82def9029b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rXjji%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u385c8bb0" id="u385c8bb0">列</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2cac4746" id="u2cac4746"><strong><span data-lake-id="uefe15ded" id="uefe15ded">OBS 用于逐层剪枝：上式损失是二次函数，初始稠密权重取得最小损失零，因此 OBS 的假设在该问题中完全成立，其公式对于这一逐层压缩目标是精确</span></strong></p><ul list="u56157e23"><li fid="ua76b4471" data-lake-id="uf5aadff6" id="uf5aadff6"><span data-lake-id="ucc33fb21" id="ucc33fb21">通过反复应用 OBS、每次删除一个权重，可以得到逐层剪枝问题的精确贪心解，即每一步都作出当前局部最优决策。该贪心过程不能保证得到全局最优解，但适用于规模过大、无法使用精确全局方法求解的问题</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="fxbbo" id="fxbbo" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub16aa04e" id="ub16aa04e">🦉</span><span data-lake-id="u96350e63" id="u96350e63"> 𝐀𝐧 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐚𝐥 𝐆𝐫𝐞𝐞𝐝𝐲 𝐒𝐨𝐥𝐯𝐞𝐫 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐒𝐩𝐚𝐫𝐬𝐢𝐭𝐲</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u8e023783" id="u8e023783"><strong><span data-lake-id="u49946a80" id="u49946a80">ExactOBS 的计算挑战：以经典形式逐个剪除权重并使用式（3）的精确更新，计算成本极高。若一层权重矩阵包含</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%3Dd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brow%7D%7Dd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f88dcaa067aa0acff70aca311ca2e5c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E4Vew%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0c55c070" id="u0c55c070">个参数，则完整 Hessian 的尺寸为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Ctimes%20d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a7aeefbe3e708360612b7e94e5fb856.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cRVML%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9f10fd28" id="u9f10fd28">。在最多</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(d)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F20e541c334e4e172d689538377a10dc7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B3NJJ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua22c2d31" id="ua22c2d31">个剪枝步骤中，每一步都需要更新并求逆 Hessian，单次求逆成本为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5CTheta(d%5E3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F109edbd02072f3d104876c17931776ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CW19N%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0deed3b4" id="u0deed3b4">，因而总时间复杂度达到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20O(d%5E4)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe2be24796b22e355c7a6704a3ba4c74c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c4SwI%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc80f6974" id="uc80f6974">，无法处理现代神经网络中参数量达到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%2210%5E5%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb8adf2d935ae0ea29374ac1287bf9965.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gTMpC%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u834c6d5f" id="u834c6d5f">至</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%2210%5E6%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc7022ea2f7be44ce2b2cc27bef201f60.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hMoPL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u10b154fd" id="u10b154fd">的大型层</span></strong></p><ul list="u2485de17"><li fid="u8c29db2c" data-lake-id="uc15d1fdc" id="uc15d1fdc"><span data-lake-id="u99b5ffaf" id="u99b5ffaf">ExactOBS 在不引入近似的条件下，将总体复杂度降低至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brow%7D%7Dd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5E3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F974609cc44482e5c1605bca0ec4ea1bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B8nkl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9fcca80" id="ua9fcca80">，显存复杂度降低至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5CTheta(d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F236b70a780368d0a426431bb960e8df1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b2WDJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1707699" id="ue1707699">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u83d8c5f9" id="u83d8c5f9" style="color: #DF2A3F">其关键是利用逐层平方误差的行级可分解结构，以及高效维护删除变量后的逆 Hessian</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u75232e7c" id="u75232e7c"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua8c71277" id="ua8c71277" style="color: #663000">处理单个权重行：逐层平方误差可以写成各输出行误差之和</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u35f77afd" id="u35f77afd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brow%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20W_%7Bi%2C%3A%7DX-W%5Ec_%7Bi%2C%3A%7DX%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F45266ba0b1b01017481f6f9563b4f135.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22caKSi%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><ul list="ucd9f030b"><li fid="u58e1455a" data-lake-id="u8adcd7c0" id="u8adcd7c0"><span data-lake-id="u6fe81b84" id="u6fe81b84" style="color: #000000">删除权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5BW%5D_%7Bij%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F175b90894696b2a5fad3d0ccedec8bfb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xkfyW%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ua77e5160" id="ua77e5160" style="color: #000000">只影响对应输出行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y_%7Bi%2C%3A%7D%3DW_%7Bi%2C%3A%7DX%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb8d9df8c4545fe11111d5f1a9953b4a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jyyZJ%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="udc105187" id="udc105187" style="color: #000000">，因此不同行之间不存在 Hessian 交互。每个权重行只需要维护一个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5C%5Ctimes%20d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6382ca1c65005fda0ff806e94212fe2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zzl6b%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u0efab27c" id="u0efab27c" style="color: #000000"> Hessian。由于每一行都作用于相同输入 X，所有行共享同一个初始 Hessian 矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%3D2XX%5E%5C%5Ctop.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F16af6ed642dfd49c63ac27874806fa4b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fxy6Q%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></li><li fid="u58e1455a" data-lake-id="u83de94bf" id="u83de94bf"><span data-lake-id="ucb5f61a3" id="ucb5f61a3" style="color: #000000">对于剪枝掩码 M，剩余权重对应的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H_M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6601fd5291276e7ba0744220fb7d7a73.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OGpN2%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u7eb9cdae" id="u7eb9cdae" style="color: #000000">只是完整 Hessian 中相应行列组成的子矩阵。因此，完整 Hessian 只需计算一次，之后根据当前掩码提取对应部分即可</span></li><li fid="u58e1455a" data-lake-id="u7191db70" id="u7191db70"><span data-lake-id="ufbf30e7a" id="ufbf30e7a" style="color: #000000">逆矩阵不能采用同样的直接截取方式，因为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(H_M)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cneq(H%5E%7B-1%7D)_M.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa3b927200586620dbbc597031a0a9941.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J7e5r%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub30e6376" id="ub30e6376" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1785561412325-a18d45cb-fd61-4fde-b33e-38835fa4b251.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud7d748e9-61fd-4821-8de2-1eb689e1d4e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uc20e9e9a-40c4-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A732.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A169%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A110734%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1077%2C%22originHeight%22%3A249%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHICHCORRESPONDSTOPERFORMINGGAUSSIANELIMINATIONOFOWANDCOLUMNPINHFO%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A187%2C%22width%22%3A956%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEWANTTOEFICTENTLYCOMPUTETHEINVERSEOFHWITHROWANDCOLUMNPREMOVEDWHICHWEDENOTEBY%22%2C%22x%22%3A8%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A1060%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MA1(ROW%26COLUMNREMOVAL).GIVENANINVERTIBLEDAXDAMATRIXHANDISIVERSEH%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A9%2C%22width%22%3A994%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E-.THISCANBEACCOMPLISHEDTHROUGHTHEJFOLLOWINGFORMUULA%22%2C%22x%22%3A6%2C%22y%22%3A66%2C%22width%22%3A692%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DOPPINGTHENCOMPLETEYTHISHASE(DTIMECOMPLEXIT%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A215%2C%22width%22%3A704%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A501%2C%22y%22%3A119%2C%22width%22%3A239%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IFOLLOWEDBY%22%2C%22x%22%3A918%2C%22y%22%3A187%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LEMMALROW%26COUMNF%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A300%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22H%E4%BA%8C%3D(%E6%97%BA%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A318%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22H-%22%2C%22x%22%3A516%2C%22y%22%3A143%2C%22width%22%3A155%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1032%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f4f2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5950a3aa%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8f6bd792" id="u8f6bd792"><strong><span data-lake-id="u59d92029" id="u59d92029" style="color: #DF2A3F">引理 1（行列删除）。给定一个可逆的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5C%5Ctimes%20d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6382ca1c65005fda0ff806e94212fe2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e5fZF%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufc387ad3" id="ufc387ad3" style="color: #DF2A3F">矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20H%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5355ca02484be171ca0d68740a3eb97.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x1dAJ%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u87d6e4ff" id="u87d6e4ff" style="color: #DF2A3F">及其逆矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2553f8059f418e5d31acb0291d9861ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XrE3t%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u99b8f061" id="u99b8f061" style="color: #DF2A3F">，现需高效计算从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20H%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5355ca02484be171ca0d68740a3eb97.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pCJRF%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6d946ecf" id="u6d946ecf" style="color: #DF2A3F">中删除第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4cd21d60552e207f237e82def9029b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ydqrj%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb5b981a" id="ubb5b981a" style="color: #DF2A3F">行和第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a0b1494d8b014da3f2bbe68b94ed5cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mbtow%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uca3238b5" id="uca3238b5" style="color: #DF2A3F">列后所得矩阵的逆。将删除后的矩阵记为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H_%7B-p%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa12d7da927fa22f62c14a52c0dd45725.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Cfoyr%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u190576a2" id="u190576a2" style="color: #DF2A3F">，则其逆可由下式获得</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u15cd616a" id="u15cd616a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5E%7B-1%7D_%7B-p%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20H%5E%7B-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5BH%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7Bpp%7D%7D%20H%5E%7B-1%7D_%7B%3A%2Cp%7DH%5E%7B-1%7D_%7Bp%2C%3A%7D%20%5C%5Cright)_%7B-p%7D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd9a7129b49b431fdd763cc2d9573b61b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QioYZ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uca57d9b3"><li fid="uf9853372" data-lake-id="u3181cccf" id="u3181cccf"><span data-lake-id="ucccf0d8f" id="ucccf0d8f">该公式等价于先在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2553f8059f418e5d31acb0291d9861ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bWLVx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3d024b5" id="ud3d024b5">上对第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4cd21d60552e207f237e82def9029b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jkli5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6cc33c4d" id="u6cc33c4d">行和第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4cd21d60552e207f237e82def9029b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YIjze%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u61471b82" id="u61471b82">列执行一次高斯消元，消除它们与其余行列之间的耦合，随后将第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4cd21d60552e207f237e82def9029b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bTJuH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u886d91fc" id="u886d91fc">行和第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4cd21d60552e207f237e82def9029b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YMtHd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u310e8fb1" id="u310e8fb1">列完全删除。由于主要计算是逆矩阵第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a0b1494d8b014da3f2bbe68b94ed5cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FMMCG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4015ca2d" id="u4015ca2d">列与第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a0b1494d8b014da3f2bbe68b94ed5cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HvYST%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4094e057" id="u4094e057">行的外积，因此该更新的时间复杂度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5CTheta(d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F236b70a780368d0a426431bb960e8df1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OcA0G%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf13e01c7" id="uf13e01c7"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc543ada2" id="uc543ada2">对完整权重矩阵执行 OBS 时，每一步需要从所有行中选择全局剪枝代价最低的权重。若为每一行同时保存一个</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5C%5Ctimes%20d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6382ca1c65005fda0ff806e94212fe2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IH9ML%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf6801c50" id="uf6801c50">逆 Hessian，显存需求将达到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brow%7D%7Dd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a71a6a80123456a437d635798441f70.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gWl2Y%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b6daa01" id="u6b6daa01">，通常难以承受</span></strong></p><ul list="u80de1851"><li fid="u0300751b" data-lake-id="uc7f8104f" id="uc7f8104f"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3c368e3" id="ub3c368e3" style="color: #2A4200">由于不同行之间不存在 Hessian 交互，一行的最终权重只取决于该行被剪除的权重数量；某一步的损失增长也只依赖该行此前的剪枝状态。因此，每一行内部的剪枝顺序可以独立确定</span></strong></li><li fid="u0300751b" data-lake-id="uf9390654" id="uf9390654"><span data-lake-id="u914c6b25" id="u914c6b25">ExactOBS 对每一行分别运行完整剪枝过程，并记录每一步的损失增量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta%20L_p%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bw_p%5E2%7D%7B%5BH%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7Bpp%7D%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff41bdc007fbdeb2aefd81281997c2dae.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XFpgD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u122f4f75" id="u122f4f75">完成全部行的处理后，算法获得整层所有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa6a72c8dfd6d38dcc696da3b5bd22988.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hPtNV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7fbb439" id="ud7fbb439">个权重的剪枝代价，再按代价从小到大选择权重，从而恢复完整矩阵上的全局 OBS 掩码。该过程只需要额外的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CTheta(d)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe10010807b1c1332f2b6b2cc0a4aa2df.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qnhfv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67c4e9d9" id="u67c4e9d9">内存</span></li><li fid="u0300751b" data-lake-id="ue3e6cab9" id="ue3e6cab9"><span data-lake-id="u2df27446" id="u2df27446">当每一行的最终剪枝集合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20M_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7284776ad19da823e4d17c23d6301fea.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WkfDm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b047983" id="u4b047983">已知后，可以利用组 OBS 公式直接求解剩余权重的最优更新</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta_%7BM_i%7D%20%3D%20H%5E%7B-1%7D_%7B%3A%2CM_i%7D%20%5C%5Cleft((H%5E%7B-1%7D)_%7BM_i%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%20w_%7BM_i%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F77facc30959e181ddad0aca408273ca0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zSMaf%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9f217038" id="u9f217038" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1785561059944-4cfabbc5-6d6b-4933-92de-254305454b27.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u97d9ea40-9271-44e9-9cff-5785526bbfe%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u64b570be-5ef3-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A723.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A239%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A120801%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1143%2C%22originHeight%22%3A377%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22FIGUREL%3AEFFCIENTGLOBALOBSUSINGTHEROW-%22%2C%22x%22%3A584%2C%22y%22%3A314%2C%22width%22%3A510%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CCORDINGTOOBSINO(KDAJ)TIME.%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A398%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HM1PRUNEK%3CDEOWEIGHTSFROM%22%2C%22x%22%3A110%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A371%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W%E4%B8%80W%E4%B8%80.%E5%8F%AF%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A80%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A305%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WITHINVERSEHESSIANHE2XX%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A445%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PAGMPEMHM%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A73%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A326%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A264%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22M%3D1%2C...%2CDCAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A211%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22H-1%3CH-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A78%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A155%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORI%3DL%2C...%2CKD0%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A211%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LESSMEMORY%3ARESOLVENOTPRUNEDWEIGHTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A691%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A306%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22M%E4%B8%80M-P%22%2C%22x%22%3A74%2C%22y%22%3A295%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WISERESULTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A579%2C%22y%22%3A346%2C%22width%22%3A380%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ESSCOMPUTE%22%2C%22x%22%3A754%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EDTRACEELEMEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A925%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HANGES%22%2C%22x%22%3A825%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E%3ALOADSTORED%22%2C%22x%22%3A843%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A326%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEIGHT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1029%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEIGHT%22%2C%22x%22%3A591%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRUNING%22%2C%22x%22%3A755%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MASK%22%2C%22x%22%3A929%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOSS%22%2C%22x%22%3A819%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RUNED%22%2C%22x%22%3A1028%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GLOBAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A928%2C%22y%22%3A104%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DENSE%22%2C%22x%22%3A591%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRACES%22%2C%22x%22%3A743%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROWS%22%2C%22x%22%3A691%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEIGHT%22%2C%22x%22%3A692%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A850%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A685%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80UP%22%2C%22x%22%3A308%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A823%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f3f1%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uafa206b7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1be52a60" id="u1be52a60"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf708b712" id="uf708b712">实际计算中，Hessian 可能因校准样本不足、输入通道失活或输入线性相关而不可逆</span></strong></p><ul list="udca8a87d"><li fid="u7081d9bf" data-lake-id="u1c4b0ed8" id="u1c4b0ed8"><span data-lake-id="u91b440b5" id="u91b440b5">样本不足可以通过增加校准样本或数据增强缓解；数值奇异问题可以通过在 Hessian 对角线上加入小的阻尼项解决</span></li><li fid="u7081d9bf" data-lake-id="ub8ca8022" id="ub8ca8022"><span data-lake-id="u32e5f248" id="u32e5f248">直接实现逐权重更新会产生大量小型 CUDA 调用。论文通过批量并行处理多个权重行，减少 kernel 启动开销并提高 GPU 利用率</span></li><li fid="u7081d9bf" data-lake-id="ub2c4531a" id="ub2c4531a"><span data-lake-id="u5b01975b" id="u5b01975b">对于已经稀疏的矩阵，可以只提取每一行的非零元素构造较小的稠密子问题，算法成本会随行密度呈三次方下降</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u53705d16" id="u53705d16"><strong><span data-lake-id="u153a3cc9" id="u153a3cc9">块剪枝要求零权重以大小为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb891664b42113aee13f0bac25eb998e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MXr4u%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uae531b85" id="uae531b85">的连续块出现，常用于 CPU 加速。此时需要联合考虑同一块内多个权重之间的相关性。设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffd1905f6d4d60accedfa6b91be93ea9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mjobq%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2bf3cafe" id="u2bf3cafe">为一个块对应的索引集合，则目标块选择和补偿更新分别为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u687444d8" id="u687444d8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_P%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7Bw_P%7D%20w_P%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cleft((H%5E%7B-1%7D)_P%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%20w_P%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cdelta_P%20%3D%20-%20H%5E%7B-1%7D_%7B%3A%2CP%7D%20%5C%5Cleft((H%5E%7B-1%7D)_P%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%20w_P.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F661b29bafddb9bc9e64eeae692eb0bff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22odnpu%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uab4f87d8"><li fid="u274175a5" data-lake-id="u3cb4193f" id="u3cb4193f"><span data-lake-id="u52fbd866" id="u52fbd866">选中一个块后，可以对其中所有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%5C%5Cin%20P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54f232b437b8536f4691327991721deb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nKffr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf0a2c889" id="uf0a2c889">依次应用式（4），从逆 Hessian 中删除对应变量。块大小为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb891664b42113aee13f0bac25eb998e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z3s7V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u03e79b14" id="u03e79b14">时，每行的步骤数下降为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%2Fc%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47d41f9dff5e3f01117e80d92d208267.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s326r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucef7636b" id="ucef7636b">，但每一步需要执行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb891664b42113aee13f0bac25eb998e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yN1YM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2d4e8051" id="u2d4e8051">次逆 Hessian 更新，因此总体渐近复杂度仍保持不变</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="T0MmB" id="T0MmB" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ubf80c7b5" id="ubf80c7b5">🐼</span><span data-lake-id="ua65b3f97" id="ua65b3f97"> 𝐓𝐡𝐞 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐚𝐥 𝐁𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐳𝐞𝐫 (𝐎𝐁𝐐)</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uae9e0517" id="uae9e0517"><strong><span data-lake-id="uca7841d7" id="uca7841d7">在通常假设当前参数点</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9b08ae6d9fed72562880f75720531bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22blFql%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc8b7868d" id="uc8b7868d">处梯度可以忽略的条件下，OBS 中最优待剪权重</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F71f73ca3f12f762592ac375b8600d785.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QJp3W%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uad2a013e" id="uad2a013e">及其对应更新</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cdelta_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4dca3ecd5ff22d859aae05c32cf729eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hHZtf%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uad7ac2dd" id="uad7ac2dd">的公式，可以通过求解一个局部二次优化问题得到。该问题要求更新向量的第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a0b1494d8b014da3f2bbe68b94ed5cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xObwG%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue8038a12" id="ue8038a12">个分量等于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-w_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff0cd9e865362414210844a88506b6d52.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fIvLp%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf80efff3" id="uf80efff3">，从而保证更新后第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a0b1494d8b014da3f2bbe68b94ed5cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P4hKv%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u369b79ad" id="u369b79ad">个权重恰好变为零。对应的拉格朗日函数为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2523c5f7" id="u2523c5f7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L(%5C%5Cdelta_p%2C%5C%5Clambda)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cdelta_p%5E%5C%5Ctop%20H%5C%5Cdelta_p%20%2B%20%5C%5Clambda%20%5C%5Cleft(%20e_p%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cdelta_p-(-w_p)%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb7559ba97b19a57ea040241eff467592.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qf4rU%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2f27b422"><li fid="ubf75605b" data-lake-id="u844f7fce" id="u844f7fce"><span data-lake-id="u5008715a" id="u5008715a">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff1b78684db901dd0b7bfa173991deab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yxbVW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uefd6a533" id="uefd6a533">表示参数点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F32a6c6f3525770720b5ef12645dd895d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NJyJq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5aa9f109" id="u5aa9f109">处的 Hessian，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22e_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F45c92d1a84ed823c36800408fa0a600f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pfDlM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u354af9be" id="u354af9be">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fabe730ea611702898c2ee836439aeef4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YcUdM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u96ebc9dc" id="u96ebc9dc">个标准基向量。最优解可以通过令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpartial%20L%2F%5C%5Cpartial%5C%5Cdelta_p%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F870ae122c20e43533f0df9658cf20781.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bMxKv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uecdac17b" id="uecdac17b">求出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fba01bb8baa87f00639b89149b566d099.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VP3Mc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u61e6de0a" id="u61e6de0a">，再将结果代回拉格朗日函数并求解 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe520c061a407db472027709bf3f73290.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vdn0w%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0fd39918" id="u0fd39918">得到</span></li><li fid="ubf75605b" data-lake-id="u85c0c527" id="u85c0c527"><span data-lake-id="u09ca130f" id="u09ca130f">现考虑将某一层的权重量化到间隔为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92e383150de88d2c19c5e098bf592a2b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xL2J7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubab26925" id="ubab26925">的固定量化网格，同时最小化量化引起的损失。为将 OBS 推广到量化投影，只需把式（6）中的约束目标由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-w_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff0cd9e865362414210844a88506b6d52.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DhdlD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u14e98fc7" id="u14e98fc7">替换为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bquant%7D(w_p)-w_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a65401fd47fa6d53126959b6280b721.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nKL0q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u36f51ab0" id="u36f51ab0">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bquant%7D(w_p)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F665e7245acf4f9d2340b5708f6024fa4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TKlbB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5eaf0fc1" id="u5eaf0fc1">表示量化舍入后的权重值。这样，更新后的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4cd21d60552e207f237e82def9029b6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vl9XY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uea52d3a9" id="uea52d3a9">个权重将恰好等于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bquant%7D(w_p)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F665e7245acf4f9d2340b5708f6024fa4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M9CFm%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1cae284e" id="u1cae284e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0b51da26" id="u0b51da26">若采用逐权重迭代量化，则可以类似地推导出当前步骤中使损失增长最小的待量化权重，以及对其余未量化权重的最优更新</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u3afc346a" id="u3afc346a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_p%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7Bw_p%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bquant%7D(w_p)-w_p%5C%5Cright)%5E2%20%7D%7B%20%5BH%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7Bpp%7D%20%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cdelta_p%20%3D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%20w_p-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bquant%7D(w_p)%20%7D%7B%20%5BH%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7Bpp%7D%20%7D%20H%5E%7B-1%7D_%7B%3A%2Cp%7D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed1135e1850e2d1320764497c4980ede.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22REqCs%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u19982d52"><li fid="u73fdd3be" data-lake-id="u294c1207" id="u294c1207"><span data-lake-id="u7e2b5608" id="u7e2b5608">由于经典 OBS 推导中的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22-w_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff0cd9e865362414210844a88506b6d52.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U3PtF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e2e613a" id="u7e2e613a">始终作为常数出现，因此只需在最终结果中将其替换为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bquant%7D(w_p)-w_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a65401fd47fa6d53126959b6280b721.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CSfp1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u177a4a15" id="u177a4a15">。由此得到的公式构成标准 OBS 剪枝公式的推广：当量化函数始终将权重映射为零时，式（7）便退化为原始 OBS</span></li><li fid="u73fdd3be" data-lake-id="u4f66e4f3" id="u4f66e4f3"><span data-lake-id="ud1e5a117" id="ud1e5a117">OBQ首先根据式（7）的指标，贪心地量化当前最容易处理的权重；随后调整其余尚未量化的权重，以补偿本次量化造成的精度损失。由于这些未量化权重的数值会随补偿更新发生变化，它们后续对应的量化值也可能随之改变。算法随后继续选择下一个权重并重复这一过程</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucfbc8b6f" id="ucfbc8b6f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u42c85884" id="u42c85884">这一贪心量化方案存在一个实际问题，尤其是在量化网格允许少量权重落在表示范围之外、以降低大多数权重量化误差的常见设定中</span></strong></p><ul list="ud195575f"><li fid="u54b26e6e" data-lake-id="ue25c3da1" id="ue25c3da1"><span data-lake-id="u749a247e" id="u749a247e">由于离群权重通常具有较大的量化误差，它们往往会被推迟到量化过程的后期。此时，尚未量化、可用于补偿该大误差的权重已经很少，因此量化离群值造成的损失难以充分吸收。中间补偿更新还可能将某些权重进一步推离量化网格，从而加重这一问题</span></li><li fid="u54b26e6e" data-lake-id="u03e7f5a9" id="u03e7f5a9"><span data-lake-id="u0c38137f" id="u0c38137f">论文采用一种简单有效的启发式策略：一旦出现离群权重，便立即对其进行量化。例如，当某个权重的量化误差大于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%CE%94%2F2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3cc0d143721914dfc827a068e0d03a7d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Lk1xZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f041aa7" id="u0f041aa7">时，将其视为离群值并优先处理，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92e383150de88d2c19c5e098bf592a2b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nnCRl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u31cfbed4" id="u31cfbed4">表示相邻量化值之间的距离。此类情况通常在每一层中只出现少数几次</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufedfdd6d" id="ufedfdd6d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1785562239665-0378acfc-b005-4ff5-8599-43cc1a353f2b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ufc0e605a-d85e-4a88-85a7-e7d298c22c1%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ueac57d0e-cad7-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A753.6%2C%22height%22%3A231%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A75401%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A942%2C%22originHeight%22%3A289%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM3QUANTIZEK%3CDEOWEIGHTSFROMRO%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A459%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22M%3D1%2C...%2CDOL%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A177%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACCORDINGTOOBSINO(KD.J)TIM%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A321%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(4(UP)%E4%B8%80P)2%22%2C%22x%22%3A299%2C%22y%22%3A130%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORI-1%2C...%2CKD0%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A177%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WP%E4%B8%804(WP))%22%2C%22x%22%3A300%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P-ARGMNOEM%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A174%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%AD%A3%E6%AD%A3%E5%85%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A276%2C%22y%22%3A195%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MM%E4%B8%80P%22%2C%22x%22%3A64%2C%22y%22%3A227%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22H-1%E4%BB%81H-%22%2C%22x%22%3A64%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OWEIGHTSFROMR%22%2C%22x%22%3A299%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A169%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HINVERSEHESSIANH%22%2C%22x%22%3A555%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A198%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A45%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W%E4%B8%80W%E4%B8%80H.%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(2XX%22%2C%22x%22%3A803%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A211%2C%22y%22%3A135%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TME.%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MWLDVC%22%2C%22x%22%3A468%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PP%22%2C%22x%22%3A257%2C%22y%22%3A181%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22H%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A200%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f8f7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u1e42772d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="gdfVF" id="gdfVF" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u6bd4dacc" id="u6bd4dacc">🦁</span><span data-lake-id="u733e4e6b" id="u733e4e6b"> 𝐆𝐏𝐓𝐐</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ua563c0f6" id="ua563c0f6"><strong><span data-lake-id="uccb5ce49" id="uccb5ce49">GPT、OPT 等模型在语言建模任务上取得突破性性能，但其参数存储和推理成本极高</span></strong></p><ul list="u3b5b2e20"><li fid="u6dd82781" data-lake-id="ue064002a" id="ue064002a"><span data-lake-id="ub430dc63" id="ub430dc63">以 1750 亿参数模型为例，即使使用 FP16 格式，模型权重仍占用约 326GB 显存，单张高端 GPU 无法容纳，推理通常依赖复杂的多卡部署</span></li><li fid="u6dd82781" data-lake-id="ub8090e6b" id="ub8090e6b"><span data-lake-id="u64f7936a" id="u64f7936a">重新训练或量化感知训练在这规模下成本过高，而当时能够扩展到千亿参数模型的方法主要采用最近邻舍入，虽然可以支持 8 bit 量化，却难在 3～4 bit 条件下保持模型精度</span></li><li fid="u6dd82781" data-lake-id="u240c0fba" id="u240c0fba"><strong><span data-lake-id="u22433c07" id="u22433c07" style="color: #5C0036">如何在不重新训练的前提下实现高压缩率、高精度且可扩展的低比特量化，构成论文试图解决的核心问题</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2113c814" id="u2113c814"><strong><span data-lake-id="u129bee0a" id="u129bee0a">论文提出 GPTQ，一种基于近似二阶信息的一次性权重量化方法</span></strong></p><ul list="uf258b441"><li fid="u01a79431" data-lake-id="u4453a92c" id="u4453a92c"><span data-lake-id="ud54faa50" id="ud54faa50">GPTQ 沿用逐层输出重构范式：利用少量校准数据，为每层寻找量化权重，使压缩层输出尽可能接近原始全精度输出，再将各层量化结果组合为完整模型</span></li><li fid="u01a79431" data-lake-id="u21421ab1" id="u21421ab1"><span data-lake-id="u59a018bc" id="u59a018bc">其理论基础来自 OBQ，即逐次量化权重并根据输入特征之间的二阶相关结构调整尚未量化的权重，从而补偿局部量化误差。GPTQ 保留这种二阶补偿能力，同时重新组织量化顺序和矩阵更新，使每层计算复杂度相较 OBQ 降低约一个权重矩阵短边维度的因子，实践中通常获得约三个数量级的加速</span></li><li fid="u01a79431" data-lake-id="u8375a043" id="u8375a043"><span data-lake-id="u205cda1f" id="u205cda1f">论文还进一步处理低计算—内存访问比以及大规模逆矩阵运算中的数值稳定性问题，使复杂的二阶量化方法能够真正扩展到千亿参数模型</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="WW2mp" id="WW2mp" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u40a582cc" id="u40a582cc">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="u585508f7" id="u585508f7"> 𝐑𝐞𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue85e71f6" id="ue85e71f6"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf1d6b867" id="uf1d6b867">量化方法大体可以分为两类：训练过程中量化，以及训练后量化</span></strong></p><ul list="ueb636185"><li fid="u9a3182e8" data-lake-id="ub710a69a" id="ub710a69a"><span data-lake-id="u66fa0bb7" id="u66fa0bb7">前者通常在大规模重新训练或微调过程中完成模型量化，并通过某种近似求导机制处理舍入操作的不可导问题。</span></li><li fid="u9a3182e8" data-lake-id="udd301103" id="udd301103"><span data-lake-id="u402a808b" id="u402a808b">训练后量化，也称一次性量化，仅使用有限的计算资源对预训练模型进行压缩，通常只需要数千个数据样本和数小时计算。对于超大规模模型而言，完整训练乃至微调都可能需要极其高昂的资源成本，因此训练后量化具有尤为重要的应用价值</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u58c54b9f" id="u58c54b9f"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub399132e" id="ub399132e">从历史上看，训练后量化研究主要集中于视觉模型，高精度方法通常以单层或若干连续层组成的小型模块为单位执行量化</span></strong></p><ul list="u6e37914a"><li fid="u2bbbf11f" data-lake-id="u52994298" id="u52994298"><span data-lake-id="u5799745a" id="u5799745a">AdaRound 通过对惩罚项进行退火，学习依赖数据的权重舍入策略，使权重逐渐趋向量化网格上的离散点</span></li><li fid="u2bbbf11f" data-lake-id="ucdf37a2b" id="ucdf37a2b"><span data-lake-id="ud15db583" id="ud15db583">BitSplit 以残差平方误差为目标，逐比特构造量化值</span></li><li fid="u2bbbf11f" data-lake-id="uaf80b033" id="uaf80b033"><span data-lake-id="u9578ca37" id="u9578ca37">AdaQuant 则借助直通估计器优化量化值</span></li><li fid="u2bbbf11f" data-lake-id="ucfcffd9a" id="ucfcffd9a"><span data-lake-id="u90471ceb" id="u90471ceb">BRECQ 将 Fisher 信息引入优化目标，并对同一残差块内的多层进行联合优化</span></li><li fid="u2bbbf11f" data-lake-id="u6eb3e778" id="u6eb3e778"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3be44e7c" id="u3be44e7c" style="color: #DF2A3F">Optimal Brain Quantization 则将经典 Optimal Brain Surgeon 的二阶权重剪枝框架推广至量化场景。OBQ 按照量化误差确定处理顺序，逐个量化权重，并同步调整其余尚未量化的权重</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udfb8a3a9" id="udfb8a3a9"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf8a9c02d" id="uf8a9c02d" style="color: #000000">随着 BLOOM 和 OPT-175B 等模型陆续开源，研究者开始探索能够以较低成本压缩此类超大模型、服务于推理部署的方法</span></strong></p><ul list="u28ee9f52"><li fid="u23719636" data-lake-id="u7bdad2cf" id="u7bdad2cf"><span data-lake-id="u65f58df7" id="u65f58df7" style="color: #000000">ZeroQuant 还提出类似 AdaQuant 的逐层知识蒸馏方法，但其能够应用的最大模型仅包含 13 亿参数。即便在这一规模下，量化过程也需要约 3 小时</span></li><li fid="u23719636" data-lake-id="ub893c610" id="ub893c610"><span data-lake-id="u3e6ea4c1" id="u3e6ea4c1" style="color: #000000">LLM.int8() 观察到，少数特征维度中的激活离群值会破坏大模型量化，因此将这些维度保留为较高精度</span></li><li fid="u23719636" data-lake-id="u39fa0385" id="u39fa0385"><span data-lake-id="u65daeafd" id="u65daeafd" style="color: #000000">nuQmm 则针对基于二进制编码的量化方案开发高效 GPU 内核，在低比特条件下单独执行某一层时，相较全精度计算能够获得显著加速</span></li><li fid="u23719636" data-lake-id="uffaa316e" id="uffaa316e"><span data-lake-id="u80dfa87e" id="u80dfa87e" style="color: #000000">GPTQ 相比此前方法将压缩收益提高一倍以上，并首次实现每个权重 3～4 bit 的高精度量化，从而带来显著的实际部署收益</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="sQy5t" id="sQy5t" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u99e04e60" id="u99e04e60">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="u3a510282" id="u3a510282"> 𝐋𝐚𝐲𝐞𝐫-𝐖𝐢𝐬𝐞 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uca05cc10" id="uca05cc10"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf1e77209" id="uf1e77209">从整体上看，GPTQ 遵循当前先进训练后量化方法的基本框架，即逐层执行量化，并针对每一层求解相应的重构问题</span></strong></p><ul list="uc10075d0"><li fid="u0414b7f7" data-lake-id="u6eaa425d" id="u6eaa425d"><span data-lake-id="uaa6c33b0" id="uaa6c33b0">具体而言，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W_%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd28804e7dd9149983c8df5ee47f2c7bd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22n6JmF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41034520" id="u41034520">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf4d12d34c64efce92a74003593d82e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VZVrj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5209836a" id="u5209836a">个线性层的权重，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X_%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f669baee60024963b6e4c85058f2bdf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YWsxo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17241c49" id="u17241c49">表示少量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01a0b33465cb6a9a84504f60af049255.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Bboni%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udac517b1" id="udac517b1">个数据样本经过网络后形成的该层输入。目标是寻找量化权重矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5Ec%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18b73d6b9f338f72670671f9cbf77acc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pp8qP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub726d71e" id="ub726d71e">，使其相对于全精度层输出的平方误差最小。形式化地，该问题可写为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8a6fcf54" id="u8a6fcf54" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cunderset%7BW%5Ec%7D%7B%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin%7D%5C%5C%3B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7CWX-W%5EcX%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f4cbc66d9150e4aa140a8d80c5b651e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oS1Ev%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue64374b0" id="ue64374b0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucef046cf" id="ucef046cf">OBQ 用于求解上述逐层量化问题，而本文对其进行一系列重要改进，使其能够扩展到大语言模型，并获得超过三个数量级的计算加速</span></strong></p><ul list="u0b975c96"><li fid="u364c994a" data-lake-id="ud61e7e2c" id="ud61e7e2c"><span data-lake-id="u61500a99" id="u61500a99">OBQ 首先观察到，式（1）可以分解为权重矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20W%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92d3fff8d076a3383c2d8bde168cb840.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gninE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u54cabe5e" id="u54cabe5e">各行平方误差之和。因此，OBQ 可以独立处理每个权重行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F32a6c6f3525770720b5ef12645dd895d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gUngy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u172816bb" id="u172816bb">：算法每次量化一个权重，并持续更新所有尚未量化的权重，以补偿单个权重量化所引入的误差</span></li><li fid="u364c994a" data-lake-id="uac5bce31" id="uac5bce31"><span data-lake-id="ua946aeb1" id="ua946aeb1">对应的目标函数是二次函数，其 Hessian 为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H_F%3D2X_FX_F%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55e6a7f4b78063f02a772f97bae345c7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HppoJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufde868c1" id="ufde868c1">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22F%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7aaf2781990aa336d909f7ebd32e2f69.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Il0ho%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uab8ecd92" id="uab8ecd92">表示当前仍保持全精度的权重集合，下一步应当量化的贪心最优权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81840ac2ba44c10bc9581fb112e5747d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fYHik%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0d17dd23" id="u0d17dd23">，以及集合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20F%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67495b0db979f20fbbdc7061797046cd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kYHhc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a6aa927" id="u7a6aa927">中所有权重的最优更新</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cdelta_F%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F563cc39aa7185954fd2b50be04789ead.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TUcZt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubdff8de8" id="ubdff8de8">，可由下式给出</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc0155f99" id="uc0155f99" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_q%20%3D%20%5C%5Cunderset%7Bw_q%7D%7B%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin%7D%5C%5C%3B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bquant%7D(w_q)-w_q%5C%5Cright)%5E2%20%7D%7B%20%5BH_F%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7Bqq%7D%20%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cdelta_F%20%3D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%20w_q-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bquant%7D(w_q)%20%7D%7B%20%5BH_F%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7Bqq%7D%20%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20(H_F%5E%7B-1%7D)_%7B%3A%2Cq%7D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5abdf6b9c05c616d4f494565e9d712a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nNqHA%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1dc1e30f"><li fid="u004942f6" data-lake-id="u653bc1b8" id="u653bc1b8"><span data-lake-id="u06ee80ab" id="u06ee80ab">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bquant%7D(w)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb78469b847b57282d70513866eb84a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LLA3f%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucd962979" id="ucd962979">表示将权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F32a6c6f3525770720b5ef12645dd895d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22clxZ4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u75cbc2ae" id="u75cbc2ae">舍入到量化网格上距离最近的数值</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u407cb558" id="u407cb558"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3bd2c7e" id="ub3bd2c7e">OBQ 反复应用上述两个公式，以迭代方式量化权重，直至权重行</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F32a6c6f3525770720b5ef12645dd895d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dNPEt%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub455f1cc" id="ub455f1cc">中的全部权重均完成量化。为避免代价高昂的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2553f8059f418e5d31acb0291d9861ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pYpTt%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc0ecd7a1" id="uc0ecd7a1">完整重计算，在量化权重</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81840ac2ba44c10bc9581fb112e5747d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M6rfX%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5563cbb4" id="u5563cbb4">后，算法直接在逆矩阵中通过一次高斯消元删除</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20H%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5355ca02484be171ca0d68740a3eb97.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y9Fkw%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u65fd186c" id="u65fd186c">的第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GTg5p%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb9bd28a" id="ubb9bd28a">行和第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4c8d653e36cd159ae269963a367e416c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l0lNL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ce9466e" id="u9ce9466e">列。更新后的逆矩阵为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uef0f38a2" id="uef0f38a2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5E%7B-1%7D_%7B-q%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20H%5E%7B-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5BH%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7Bqq%7D%7D%20H%5E%7B-1%7D_%7B%3A%2Cq%7DH%5E%7B-1%7D_%7Bq%2C%3A%7D%20%5C%5Cright)_%7B-p%7D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F98b6f5f8d9c19411794a28bb4d54c207.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sRJU2%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u00c65b11"><li fid="ue4d49852" data-lake-id="ud8538f37" id="ud8538f37"><span data-lake-id="ude1c2928" id="ude1c2928">对于尺寸为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brow%7D%7D%5C%5Ctimes%20d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcbd2e62941c38af51e0b94c59d33e164.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FbWfU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d49f48d" id="u6d49f48d">的权重矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa36915ecf0b5605493f5aeaf1480a9ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zNkah%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u34762a90" id="u34762a90">，OBQ 的运行时间对输入维度具有三次依赖</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brow%7D%7Dd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5E3%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F813199b20189a9ac5d5cce8583a9d29f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gJSkw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uda7e78ce" id="uda7e78ce">因此，将原始 OBQ 直接应用于拥有数十亿参数的模型在计算上不可行</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="KyO4n" id="KyO4n" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uc0b12053" id="uc0b12053">⚙️</span><span data-lake-id="u261778d0" id="u261778d0"> 𝐓𝐡𝐞 𝐆𝐏𝐓𝐐 𝐀𝐥𝐠𝐨𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐡𝐦</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u21420217" id="u21420217"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b452ef4" id="u6b452ef4" style="color: #101E60">OBQ 按照贪心顺序量化权重，即在每一步都选择当前会引起最小额外量化误差的权重。值得注意的是，尽管这种自然的策略确实具有良好表现，但与按照任意顺序量化权重相比，其改进通常较为有限，尤其是在规模较大且高度过参数化的网络层中</span></strong></p><ul list="u3f95ad14"><li fid="u3257fc87" data-lake-id="u109d9278" id="u109d9278"><span data-lake-id="uf1a68f91" id="uf1a68f91">一种可能的解释是，贪心顺序虽然能够在一定程度上减少具有较大单点量化误差的权重数量，但这些权重往往会被推迟到量化过程的后期。此时，仅剩少量尚未量化的权重可以通过调整来补偿其量化误差，从而抵消贪心排序带来的部分收益。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud20e0bb8" id="ud20e0bb8" style="color: #70000D">由此产生的一个重要观察是：对于大模型而言，任意固定的量化顺序也可能取得较好的结果，而这一观察将带来重要的算法影响</span></strong></li><li fid="u3257fc87" data-lake-id="u78514b55" id="u78514b55"><span data-lake-id="u28764ffe" id="u28764ffe" style="color: #000000">原始 OBQ 方法分别独立量化权重矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20W%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92d3fff8d076a3383c2d8bde168cb840.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jRUbv%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ucfa26de1" id="ucfa26de1" style="color: #000000">的各个行，并依据相应的量化误差为每一行确定特定的量化顺序。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue06c196e" id="ue06c196e" style="color: #AE146E">相比之下，GPTQ 使所有权重行按照相同的顺序进行量化，并表明这种处理通常能够获得与原始 OBQ 解相近的最终平方误差</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u640bf04d" id="u640bf04d" style="color: #000000">​</span></li><li fid="u3257fc87" data-lake-id="ua16eac78" id="ua16eac78"><span data-lake-id="uabbd9f69" id="uabbd9f69" style="color: #000000">由此，在量化过程的任意阶段，所有权重行都具有相同的未量化权重集合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20F%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67495b0db979f20fbbdc7061797046cd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sHRcJ%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u461aaec6" id="u461aaec6" style="color: #000000">，对应的逆 Hessian</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H_F%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f84fb1bc0063e0cf44d3936089da4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c7sn9%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u4becc077" id="u4becc077" style="color: #000000">也对所有行保持一致。其原因在于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H_F%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf27709a2c2f04318a63c5a9bda2d096.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i2wxx%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u460b7d65" id="u460b7d65" style="color: #000000">仅依赖当前未量化权重所对应的层输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_F%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc31389ddf9cffe899df293b1058e5dd4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Diunk%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="uad35edff" id="uad35edff" style="color: #000000">，而各个输出行共享相同的输入；它并不依赖具体的权重数值</span></li><li fid="u3257fc87" data-lake-id="uacb4411a" id="uacb4411a"><span data-lake-id="uef05a134" id="uef05a134" style="color: #000000">因此，式（3）中的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H_F%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f84fb1bc0063e0cf44d3936089da4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WD8mC%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ueab2dfaa" id="ueab2dfaa" style="color: #000000">更新只需执行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F506403b90a368af049ed1bbcb8678a93.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sovYC%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d96720a" id="u6d96720a" style="color: #000000">次，即每个权重列执行一次，而不再需要执行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brow%7D%7Dd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7540e770f84cc90d817e96203edae80.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JrLCq%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e2b758f" id="u6e2b758f" style="color: #000000">次，即为每个标量权重分别执行一次。这样，总体运行复杂度由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brow%7D%7Dd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5E3%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb3a1d47ecd80e80ff49e10cd0e58ce7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pDG26%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u211f404d" id="u211f404d" style="color: #000000">降低为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmax%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7B%20d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brow%7D%7Dd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5E2%2C%20d_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5E3%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F39293f3407a71ce00891db8d2b6949bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L9cYx%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u7b6ac014" id="u7b6ac014" style="color: #000000">相当于获得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin%5C%5C%7Bd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Brow%7D%7D%2Cd_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcol%7D%7D%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d1a8d10e1c218f8da2ed7b6f8e1e9ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OHIvO%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3a6c91e" id="uf3a6c91e" style="color: #000000">倍的渐近加速</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc6d22bdb" id="uc6d22bdb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u871a1ac1" id="u871a1ac1">首先，直接实现上述方案在实际中仍然无法获得较高速度，因为该算法的计算量与内存访问量之比较低。例如，式（3）需要更新一个可能非常庞大的矩阵中的全部元素，但对每个元素仅执行少量浮点运算。这类操作无法充分利用现代 GPU 强大的计算能力，其性能会受到显著较低的显存带宽限制</span></strong></p><ul list="u684ed2db"><li fid="ue4a45a1d" data-lake-id="u173b17f2" id="u173b17f2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u067b62c0" id="u067b62c0" style="color: #2A4200">第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c6f609fb47bb3cfc121433cb2de7a84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eGKeg%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u424c69c8" id="u424c69c8" style="color: #2A4200">列的最终舍入决策只会受到作用于该列本身的更新影响，因此，在当前处理阶段，对后续列的更新与第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c6f609fb47bb3cfc121433cb2de7a84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GAARA%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3f630470" id="u3f630470" style="color: #2A4200">列的舍入结果无关。这使得多个更新可以被批量合并，从而显著提高 GPU 利用率</span></strong></li><li fid="ue4a45a1d" data-lake-id="u627c83ef" id="u627c83ef"><span data-lake-id="u8a194192" id="u8a194192">具体而言，GPTQ 每次处理</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B%3D128%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd5c604b6916ea7481bba64aeeae83f7e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rf0ia%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u714862cd" id="u714862cd">个连续权重列，并在处理过程中将更新限制在这些列以及</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2553f8059f418e5d31acb0291d9861ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mJHAE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u10f22a32" id="u10f22a32">中相应的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B%5C%5Ctimes%20B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff2d3bcf545c5d1fd0893c286863ba688.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vri2O%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7acb8b35" id="u7acb8b35">子块内。只有当整个列块完成量化后，算法才使用式（2）和式（3）的多权重推广形式，对完整的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2553f8059f418e5d31acb0291d9861ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22I1m0T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6361f2d4" id="u6361f2d4">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa36915ecf0b5605493f5aeaf1480a9ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O3nVl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89386463" id="u89386463">矩阵执行全局更新。其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yhPAx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89eaccf4" id="u89eaccf4">表示当前列块对应的索引集合，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H_%7B-Q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F446026d84125de71a131f4456e65d950.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eo1UJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1568ed6b" id="u1568ed6b">表示删除集合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TPCNC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8c339fa8" id="u8c339fa8">所对应行列后的逆矩阵</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9b422470" id="u9b422470" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta_F%20%3D%20-%20%5C%5Cleft(%20w_Q-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bquant%7D(w_Q)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5BH_F%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7BQQ%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%20(H_F%5E%7B-1%7D)_%7B%3A%2CQ%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd55325fdf89557c6b441966436afaab7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xMyms%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6abdbc91" id="u6abdbc91" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H_%7B-Q%7D%5E%7B-1%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20H%5E%7B-1%7D%20-%20H%5E%7B-1%7D_%7B%3A%2CQ%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5BH%5E%7B-1%7D%5D_%7BQQ%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%20H%5E%7B-1%7D_%7BQ%2C%3A%7D%20%5C%5Cright)_%7B-Q%7D.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3063469ae1e9b8d4ab0ef83ac03a36bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dagPN%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3b3dc17b"><li fid="ua7af6500" data-lake-id="ua4c2da58" id="ua4c2da58"><span data-lake-id="ufe192841" id="ufe192841">尽管这一策略并未减少理论上的总计算量，但它有效缓解内存吞吐瓶颈。通过将大量细粒度更新合并为较大规模的矩阵运算，该方法能够显著提高 GPU 的数据复用率和计算利用率。在超大模型上，这一设计可在实践中带来约一个数量级的加速，因此构成 GPTQ 算法的关键组成部分</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0c7e0cf4" id="u0c7e0cf4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a272b7d" id="u9a272b7d">最后一个需要解决的技术问题来自数值误差。在现有大模型的规模下，这类误差可能变得十分严重，尤其是在与前一步中的分块更新结合使用时</span></strong></p><ul list="u590ff62b"><li fid="ua50da71b" data-lake-id="u4c89d684" id="u4c89d684"><span data-lake-id="udf65d818" id="udf65d818">具体而言，剩余未量化权重所对应的逆 Hessian 可能在计算过程中失去正定性并变为不定矩阵。作者观察到，这会使算法沿错误方向对剩余权重施加过大的更新，进而导致相应层的量化结果严重恶化。在实践中，该问题的发生概率会随模型规模增长而提高；对于参数量超过数十亿的模型，几乎可以确定至少有少数层会出现这一现象。其主要原因似乎在于式（5）的反复应用会持续累积数值误差，尤其是其中附加的矩阵求逆操作</span></li><li fid="ua50da71b" data-lake-id="ufe43e1e6" id="ufe43e1e6"><span data-lake-id="uc50b2882" id="uc50b2882">对于较小模型，通常可以通过阻尼缓解这一问题，即在 Hessian 的对角元素上加入一个较小的常数。本文始终将该常数设为 Hessian 平均对角值的 1%。然而，仅依赖阻尼不足以保证大模型量化过程的稳定性，因此还需要更加稳健和通用的处理方式</span></li><li fid="ua50da71b" data-lake-id="ud891238b" id="ud891238b"><span data-lake-id="uadc9723c" id="uadc9723c">作者首先注意到，在量化第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4c8d653e36cd159ae269963a367e416c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mtXNr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7d99bed" id="ud7d99bed">个权重时，算法从当前未量化权重集合对应的逆 Hessian 中实际需要的信息仅为第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4c8d653e36cd159ae269963a367e416c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wXdcs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d2d0e8b" id="u7d2d0e8b">行；更准确地说，只需要该行从对角元素开始向后的部分。因此，可以采用数值上更加稳定的方法预先计算所有这些行，而不会显著增加内存开销</span></li><li fid="ua50da71b" data-lake-id="u5aeb155f" id="u5aeb155f"><span data-lake-id="udc592a69" id="udc592a69">对于对称的逆 Hessian，式（3）所执行的逐步行列删除，本质上与 Cholesky 分解中的消元过程相对应。二者仅存在一个细微差异：Cholesky 分解会使用当前对角元素的平方根对第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BEZca%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u064743ce" id="u064743ce">行进行归一化</span></li><li fid="ua50da71b" data-lake-id="u0a5e9c66" id="u0a5e9c66"><strong><span data-lake-id="u36422670" id="u36422670" style="color: #DF2A3F">基于这一关系，GPTQ 可以直接利用成熟且高度优化的 Cholesky 内核，预先计算后续量化过程中所需的全部逆 Hessian 信息。结合轻度阻尼后，该方法具有足够的数值稳定性，可以可靠应用于超大规模模型；与此同时，高度优化的 Cholesky 实现还能够带来额外的运行加速</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0f6c8014" id="u0f6c8014" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1785678955299-1936388c-0a64-4246-ac7c-6400b1386a28.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uddfbfd34-d5e6-43e2-8e5c-4e3388b30a8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ua9046979-02bb-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A668.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A238%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A118882%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1083%2C%22originHeight%22%3A385%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22GIVENINVERSEHESSIANH%3D(2XX%2BAL)%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A534%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM1QUANTIZEW%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A286%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B-I%2BWJ-QJ)H%22%2C%22x%22%3A82%2C%22y%22%3A227%2C%22width%22%3A352%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2F%2FUPDATEALLREMAININGWEIGHTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A536%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A305%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HESSIANIVERSEINFORMMATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A539%2C%22y%22%3A122%2C%22width%22%3A291%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3A(%E8%AE%A1B%E4%B8%80I%E8%BF%87%E5%85%836%E5%B0%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A77%2C%22y%22%3A261%2C%22width%22%3A350%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2FUPDATEWEIGHTSINBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A535%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A250%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E8%AE%A1B)%3A%E5%9C%B0%3A%2BB.6%E7%A4%BEB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A318%2C%22width%22%3A333%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANDBLOCKSIZEB.%22%2C%22x%22%3A791%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A204%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUANTIZEDOTPUUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A537%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A196%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORJ%3DI%2C...%2CI%E5%8D%81B-1D0%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A304%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLOCKQUANTIZATIONERRORS%22%2C%22x%22%3A536%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A272%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUANTIZATIONERVOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A535%2C%22y%22%3A231%2C%22width%22%3A204%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QI-QUANT(W)%22%2C%22x%22%3A67%2C%22y%22%3A200%2C%22width%22%3A275%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORI%3D0%2CB%2C2B%2C..%2CD0%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A146%2C%22width%22%3A261%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22H--CHOLESKY(H)%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A118%2C%22width%22%3A255%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Q-0DOWXDCO%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A157%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUANTIZECOUUNNN%22%2C%22x%22%3A534%2C%22y%22%3A201%2C%22width%22%3A184%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%E4%B8%80UDOXB%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A163%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A345%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A4%BE%3A(%2BB).(%2BB%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A246%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f6f4%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u892a891a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="omTQJ" id="omTQJ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9e2dcf6d" id="u9e2dcf6d">🦏</span><span data-lake-id="u8a1ad532" id="u8a1ad532"> 𝐀𝐖𝐐: 𝐀𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐕𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍-𝐀𝐖𝐀𝐑𝐄 𝐖𝐄𝐈𝐆𝐇𝐓 𝐐𝐔𝐀𝐍𝐓𝐈𝐙𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u2573996b" id="u2573996b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u98dfa8d5" id="u98dfa8d5">对于端侧 LLM 推理而言，低比特权重量化能够显著降低模型的内存占用，但实现高质量的低比特量化并非易事</span></strong></p><ul list="uee75ff3e"><li fid="udf588d1d" data-lake-id="u5b557b7c" id="u5b557b7c"><span data-lake-id="u5a492045" id="u5a492045">量化感知训练由于训练成本较高而缺乏效率，而后训练量化在低比特设置下通常会产生较大的精度下降</span></li><li fid="udf588d1d" data-lake-id="u6f0defe8" id="u6f0defe8"><span data-lake-id="ub4f5ccf9" id="ub4f5ccf9">与本文最为相关的方法是 GPTQ，其利用二阶信息进行量化误差补偿。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubc6ef7a1" id="ubc6ef7a1" style="color: #663000">然而，其重构过程可能使模型过拟合于校准集，并在分布外领域中改变模型原本学习到的特征。由于 LLM 通常被作为具有通用能力的模型使用，这一问题尤为值得关注</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9f0d643d" id="u9f0d643d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u460ef7fe" id="u460ef7fe">本文提出 Activation-aware Weight Quantization（AWQ，激活感知权重量化），这是一种面向 LLM 低比特、仅权重量化的硬件友好型方法</span></strong></p><ul list="uff52107c"><li fid="u8396198c" data-lake-id="ue82232db" id="ue82232db"><span data-lake-id="u7233323a" id="u7233323a">该方法基于一个观察：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9ed9b63" id="ud9ed9b63" style="color: #AD1A2B">不同权重对于 LLM 性能的重要程度并不相同。模型中存在少量约占 0.1%–1% 的显著权重（salient weights）；若不对这些显著权重进行量化，则能够显著降低量化损失</span></strong></li><li fid="u8396198c" data-lake-id="uccd8d45c" id="uccd8d45c"><span data-lake-id="ud5b5df7c" id="ud5b5df7c">为确定这些显著权重对应的通道，本文的核心思路是：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u95f4d2c1" id="u95f4d2c1" style="color: #2A4200">尽管所研究的是仅权重量化，但在判断权重的重要性时，应当参考激活分布而非权重分布。与较大激活幅值相对应的权重通道更加显著，因为这些通道负责处理更为重要的输入特征</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8ca0679c" id="u8ca0679c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790081233566-7daa1827-e2ad-4f55-9b3c-0e1c54731fc3.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua314153e-930c-4edd-b579-782d6578150%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u7cbcdd7c-61b9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A595%2C%22height%22%3A212%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A179197%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A830%2C%22originHeight%22%3A296%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22TINYCHATCOMPUTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A135%2C%22width%22%3A183%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM%3AAO%22%2C%22x%22%3A372%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CODELLAMALLAVA%22%2C%22x%22%3A375%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A203%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CTA%22%2C%22x%22%3A46%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A143%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YSTEM%3ATINPCHAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A369%2C%22y%22%3A244%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EDGEGPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A683%2C%22y%22%3A111%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(ARMCPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A261%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ARMCPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A680%2C%22y%22%3A255%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EDGEGPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A157%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STARCODER%22%2C%22x%22%3A286%2C%22y%22%3A130%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22x%22%3A343%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RASPBERRYPI%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FALCON%22%2C%22x%22%3A441%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MACBOOK%22%2C%22x%22%3A684%2C%22y%22%3A235%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISTRAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A531%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAPTOP%22%2C%22x%22%3A700%2C%22y%22%3A90%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22M%E4%BC%81T%22%2C%22x%22%3A345%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A64%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A549%2C%22y%22%3A145%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A3%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAMA%22%2C%22x%22%3A251%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c1b19f%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9e43bca6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u60c41997" id="u60c41997"><strong><span data-lake-id="u66f6e059" id="u66f6e059" style="color: #000000">直接将部分重要权重保留为高精度会引入硬件效率较低的混合精度实现。为避免这一问题，本文从权重量化误差出发进行分析，并指出：通过对显著通道进行适当放大，可以降低这些通道的相对量化误差</span></strong></p><ul list="u468986b3"><li fid="u4590fb19" data-lake-id="u83f7c2c6" id="u83f7c2c6"><span data-lake-id="u354e2811" id="u354e2811">作者设计一种逐通道缩放（per-channel scaling）方法，通过自动搜索最优缩放因子，在对全部权重进行量化的条件下尽可能减小量化误差。AWQ 不依赖反向传播或重构，因此能够在不过拟合校准集的情况下，更好地保持 LLM 在不同领域和不同模态上的泛化能力</span></li><li fid="u4590fb19" data-lake-id="u4be27408" id="u4be27408"><span data-lake-id="u4ace6feb" id="u4ace6feb">作者进一步设计 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uecc49bab" id="uecc49bab">TinyChat</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud6435de2" id="ud6435de2">，一个面向端侧 LLM 推理的高效推理框架，用于将 4 比特量化所带来的理论内存节省转化为实际的推理加速</span></li><li fid="u4590fb19" data-lake-id="u6839f67a" id="u6839f67a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u066b730b" id="u066b730b" style="color: #004347">TinyChat 通过运行时即时反量化显著加速线性层计算，同时利用高效的 4 比特权重打包以及 kernel fusion，降低中间 DRAM 访问和 kernel 启动等推理开销。由此，即使计算机系统通常采用字节对齐的存储方式，也能够更充分地获得 4 比特权重量化带来的性能收益</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="C0GGc" id="C0GGc" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4d7e6e26" id="u4d7e6e26">🦖</span><span data-lake-id="ue599d104" id="ue599d104"> 𝐑𝐄𝐋𝐀𝐓𝐄𝐃 𝐖𝐎𝐑𝐊</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uced44569" id="uced44569"><strong><span data-lake-id="uacb9ce85" id="uacb9ce85">模型量化通过降低深度学习模型中的数值精度来减少模型规模并加速推理。现有量化技术通常可以划分为两类：量化感知训练和后训练量化</span></strong></p><ul list="u335ce630"><li fid="u5b414989" data-lake-id="u51984a41" id="u51984a41"><span data-lake-id="ubbc33157" id="ubbc33157">QAT 依赖反向传播来更新量化后的权重；PTQ 通常不需要训练</span></li><li fid="u5b414989" data-lake-id="u2ccbfd42" id="u2ccbfd42"><span data-lake-id="ucae46035" id="ucae46035">由于 QAT 方法难以直接扩展到 LLM 这类大规模模型，因此在 LLM 量化中通常采用 PTQ 方法</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u240426f6" id="u240426f6"><strong><span data-lake-id="uedb3caa1" id="uedb3caa1">现有 LLM 量化研究主要关注两类设置。第一类是 W8A8 量化，即将激活和权重均量化为 INT8。第二类是低比特仅权重量化，例如 W4A16，其中仅将权重量化为低比特整数，而激活保持较高精度</span></strong></p><ul list="uf8a785e2"><li fid="u1294786d" data-lake-id="uc7399224" id="uc7399224"><span data-lake-id="ua8f0c45e" id="ua8f0c45e">本文主要关注第二类设置。这是因为，仅权重量化不仅能够降低硬件部署门槛，即减少模型所需的内存容量，还能够加速 token 生成过程，因为这种方法能够缓解推理过程中由内存带宽限制所导致的瓶颈</span></li><li fid="u1294786d" data-lake-id="u296953fb" id="u296953fb"><span data-lake-id="u0d2965d1" id="u0d2965d1">除基础的最近邻舍入方法之外，与本文最相关的方法是 GPTQ。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2d228eed" id="u2d228eed" style="color: #004347">然而，GPTQ 的重构过程可能导致模型对校准集产生过拟合，从而无法充分保持 LLM 在其他模态和领域中的通用能力。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf691c9b2" id="uf691c9b2">此外，对于某些模型，例如 LLaMA-7B 和 OPT-66B，GPTQ 还需要使用额外的重排序技巧才能获得较好的量化效果</span></li><li fid="u1294786d" data-lake-id="u353860d2" id="u353860d2"><span data-lake-id="u59e7f322" id="u59e7f322">除面向通用硬件设计的量化方法之外，SpAtten 提出一种渐进式方法，用于逐步增加 Softmax 计算所采用的比特数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1abc1ce6" id="u1abc1ce6"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud5e11121" id="ud5e11121">低比特量化 LLM 已成为降低推理成本的一种常用方案，因此已有多种系统针对低比特模型提供实际的推理加速支持</span></strong></p><ul list="uae6062d1"><li fid="u55103cd1" data-lake-id="ue08d98b4" id="ue08d98b4"><span data-lake-id="u5038319b" id="u5038319b">GPTQ 为 OPT 模型提供 INT3 kernel；GPTQ-for-LLaMA 则借助 Triton 进一步扩展对经过重排序的 INT4 量化模型的 kernel 支持</span></li><li fid="u55103cd1" data-lake-id="u3fb02cbe" id="u3fb02cbe"><span data-lake-id="u1c90a931" id="u1c90a931">FlexGen、llama.cpp 和 exllama 采用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue705797c" id="ue705797c">分组式 INT4 量化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uef66d225" id="uef66d225">，以降低 I/O 成本及模型卸载相关开销</span></li><li fid="u55103cd1" data-lake-id="u807bbd91" id="u807bbd91"><span data-lake-id="udfaafc48" id="udfaafc48">FasterTransformer 实现用于仅权重量化的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4823ab92" id="u4823ab92">FP16 × INT4 GEMM</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1454c596" id="u1454c596">，但其采用的是逐张量量化，并不支持分组量化</span></li><li fid="u55103cd1" data-lake-id="udb3bace2" id="udb3bace2"><span data-lake-id="u079d71af" id="u079d71af">LUT-GEMM 则利用查找表，在 GPU CUDA Core 上执行按位计算。与本文同期开展的工作 MLC-LLM 借助 TVM 后端，在多种边缘 CPU 和 GPU 平台上取得良好的性能</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="qgGxr" id="qgGxr" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u283db176" id="u283db176">🦧</span><span data-lake-id="u098e59c8" id="u098e59c8"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud436e52e" id="ud436e52e">𝐈𝐦𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐯𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐋𝐋𝐌 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐛𝐲 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝟏% 𝐒𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐖𝐞𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐬</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="ua9414193" id="ua9414193"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue643ce21" id="ue643ce21" style="color: #AD1A2B">量化将浮点数映射为低比特整数，是降低 LLM 模型规模和推理成本的一种有效方法。作者首先提出一种仅权重量化方法，通过保护更为重要的权重，在无需训练或回归的情况下提高量化精度；随后进一步提出一种数据驱动方法，用于搜索能够降低量化误差的最优缩放因子</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u6f0bc48f" id="u6f0bc48f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790081950212-caa2b53c-74e5-4bea-b732-0299c3dccba9.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc56fcb3a-e6ba-4154-b094-4d22395bad3%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u25df454c-b062-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A916%2C%22height%22%3A218%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A125547%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1427%2C%22originHeight%22%3A339%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22KEPI%25SALIENTWEIGHTSINFP16(PPL13.0)(C)SCALETHEWEIGHTSBETOREQUANTIZATION(PPL13.0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A405%2C%22y%22%3A301%2C%22width%22%3A1026%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DETERMINETHESALIENT%22%2C%22x%22%3A407%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A222%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NQUANTIZATIONPPL%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A237%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADHARDWAREEFFICIENC%22%2C%22x%22%3A609%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A199%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CALEBEFOREQUANTIZE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1036%2C%22y%22%3A85%2C%22width%22%3A206%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AVERAGEMAG.%22%2C%22x%22%3A1100%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B24-3.5-2.8-3%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A214%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QWNT3%22%2C%22x%22%3A197%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTVATION.%22%2C%22x%22%3A406%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QMIXPREE%22%2C%22x%22%3A688%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B0.1-3.8%2B2.4%2B%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-09%2B1.6-2.5-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B1.2-0.2-24-34%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BKEEPIOSALIENTWEIGH%22%2C%22x%22%3A384%2C%22y%22%3A303%2C%22width%22%3A267%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222.5-3.5%2B1.9%E5%8D%811.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WELGHTSBY%22%2C%22x%22%3A408%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-3.5%2B1.5%2B0.5-0.1%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A154%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B1.8-1.6-3.2-%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A188%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONT3%22%2C%22x%22%3A1257%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B0.9%2B3.3-1.9%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B1%2B0-2-3%22%2C%22x%22%3A202%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VFP16%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224%2B2%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A239%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B2-3-2%22%2C%22x%22%3A226%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%811%2B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A708%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22-2.5-3.5%2B1.%22%2C%22x%22%3A705%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.9%2B1.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A779%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6eeeb%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u69c712b0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6faddccb" id="u6faddccb"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufc266a09" id="ufc266a09">作者观察到，LLM 中不同权重的重要性并不相同：其中存在一小部分显著权重（salient weights），它们相比其他权重对模型性能更加重要。在不进行任何训练或回归的情况下，如果跳过对这些显著权重的量化，就可以缓解由量化损失导致的性能下降</span></strong></p><ul list="uab4f7f8e"><li fid="u55da4174" data-lake-id="ubfc01460" id="ubfc01460"><span data-lake-id="u04eb5d56" id="u04eb5d56">一种常用的权重重要性判断方式是考察权重的幅值或</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20L_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb366aa9e989beffc9da36f03a6a71f9a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oIZIV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua34c4300" id="ua34c4300">范数。然而，实验发现，跳过具有较大权重范数的通道，即按照权重本身选择 FP16 通道，并不能显著提升量化后的模型性能，其改善幅度与随机选择通道相近</span></li><li fid="u55da4174" data-lake-id="u84955b4e" id="u84955b4e"><span data-lake-id="u6fe4bfec" id="u6fe4bfec">值得注意的是，如果依据</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u51e23408" id="u51e23408">激活幅值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2dbd4cfb" id="u2dbd4cfb">来选择权重通道，那么即使仅将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220.1%5C%5C%25%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5361d267521f1ca97f1895ceaff97ea.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22THKe0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u768bb7e4" id="u768bb7e4">的通道保留为 FP16，也可以显著改善模型性能</span></li><li fid="u55da4174" data-lake-id="uf5afcf12" id="uf5afcf12"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6fce4a1c" id="u6fce4a1c" style="color: #663000">作者推测，幅值更大的输入特征通常更加重要。因此，将与这些输入特征对应的权重保留为 FP16，可以更好地保存这些重要特征，从而改善模型性能</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubd2c38fd" id="ubd2c38fd"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc25e0cd6" id="uc25e0cd6" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">局限性：尽管仅将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%200.1%5C%5C%25%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd9bf9c4753b1d6afc70314c00b645bde.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d1EvX%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0f29f671" id="u0f29f671" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">的权重保留为 FP16，就能够在几乎不增加总体模型大小的情况下改善量化性能，但这种混合精度数据格式会增加系统实现的复杂性。因此，需要设计一种新的方法，在不真正将这些重要权重保留为 FP16 的情况下，对其进行有效保护</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="V34MO" id="V34MO" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1e3cde29" id="u1e3cde29">🐫</span><span data-lake-id="u9d6b7c55" id="u9d6b7c55"> 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐒𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐖𝐞𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐬 𝐛𝐲 𝐀𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-𝐚𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐒𝐜𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u8a40d6f6" id="u8a40d6f6"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucd9cb2d6" id="ucd9cb2d6">为降低显著权重的量化误差，同时避免混合精度实现带来的硬件效率问题，作者提出一种基于逐通道缩放的方法。首先考虑仅权重量化所引入的误差。对于某个权重 group/block </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F31598feb6f8efa426da0e9fb43a9537e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ANkUI%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u632e3b97" id="u632e3b97">，其线性计算可以表示为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7Dx%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8dcc8200669cbd0a77ed8d77d7139648.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gKkSC%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud063049e" id="ud063049e">，量化后的计算则为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%3DQ(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D)x.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4601ffd4d52ac94e651502378416f3fa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ipVHx%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua5bc3f12" id="ua5bc3f12">具体而言，量化函数定义为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u106960bc" id="u106960bc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D)%3D%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRound%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%7B%5C%5CDelta%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5CDelta%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmax(%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7C)%7D%7B2%5E%7BN-1%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8d31642f1a49cceb120e02798affb2e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d90dd%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u49e79945"><li fid="u54f21062" data-lake-id="u99fc4177" id="u99fc4177"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wLI37%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9321bc80" id="u9321bc80">表示量化比特数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cbe179fa77b5a6af5c84309f72dd808.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JHbJ1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucc1851c6" id="ucc1851c6">表示由权重绝对值最大值确定的量化尺度。考虑权重组中的一个元素</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2c1224557f50e8d12ab3ec963fb0a745.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ffLm5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc043c8f5" id="uc043c8f5">。如果将该权重乘以一个缩放因子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3E1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F583fadefd811e343f5eea148a507445b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ycGJH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued21cede" id="ued21cede">，同时将对应的输入除以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hms7J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub435fd24" id="ub435fd24">，那么浮点计算本身保持不变，而量化后的计算变为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u34ee4746" id="u34ee4746" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Ccdot%20s)%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx%7D%7Bs%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5CDelta'%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRound%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7Ds%7D%7B%5C%5CDelta'%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Ccdot%20x%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bs%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb1d666522c29ae4a4b81110cc325af30.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qXjUa%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua8a46d79"><li fid="u49cfc5b3" data-lake-id="ufffaae66" id="ufffaae66"><span data-lake-id="ue84a3ccb" id="ue84a3ccb">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta'%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F137d057ff90c146fb01aa169fd78e1ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fH6sa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u95002b32" id="u95002b32">表示应用缩放因子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EQhPs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u54fdeb0b" id="u54fdeb0b">后得到的新量化尺度。作者基于实验得到以下观察：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRound%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa8030ce06dc96548aee867f319a0bcc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nclZx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u74d62a8e" id="u74d62a8e">所产生的期望舍入误差基本保持不变。由于舍入操作将浮点数映射为整数，其误差大致均匀分布于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B0%2C0.5%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc56519b950cea63b1fcf51228cded3d7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WmueH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u86a0f662" id="u86a0f662">，因此平均误差约为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220.25%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5b1488dbe99e6249672928320eea185.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cqvfD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6117650c" id="u6117650c">，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRoundErr%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%5C%5Capprox0.25%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc2650ece28b4fa963049e615062fa28f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JT7jY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u81fa336b" id="u81fa336b">。对单个权重元素进行放大，通常不会改变整个权重 group 中的最大值，因此有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta'%5C%5Capprox%5C%5CDelta.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b32085e6147bba6025c9e3e1950a3d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22do2YJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e7a024e" id="u4e7a024e">因此，原始量化计算产生的误差可以表示为：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8215ce9f" id="u8215ce9f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BErr%7D(Q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D)x)%20%3D%20%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRoundErr%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%7B%5C%5CDelta%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Ccdot%20x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F558c17960d3054419f071b175f5870b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OKL4G%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud0ecd079"><li fid="u5e497e44" data-lake-id="u65247632" id="u65247632"><span data-lake-id="u2526d617" id="u2526d617">采用缩放之后，误差变为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1d3a6eee" id="u1d3a6eee" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BErr%7D%5C%5Cleft(%20Q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%5C%5Ccdot%20s)%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx%7D%7Bs%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20%5C%5CDelta'%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRoundErr%7D%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7Ds%7D%7B%5C%5CDelta'%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Ccdot%20x%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bs%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8f7351c13bcc73f2da22ebe4b01e937f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lpRxJ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3b20c5e5"><li fid="uce408889" data-lake-id="udbcbbf15" id="udbcbbf15"><span data-lake-id="u2ba765c4" id="u2ba765c4">新误差相对于原始误差的比例近似为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5CDelta'%7D%7B%5C%5CDelta%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bs%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0483eb239aeed14e8afe50edd963f79.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vEBNJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud97b6677" id="ud97b6677">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta'%5C%5Capprox%5C%5CDelta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F555dd8ca9f1aec801d0b3695fb67a3e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ayE2T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue4a1b32e" id="ue4a1b32e">且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3E1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F583fadefd811e343f5eea148a507445b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rTKpe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5a591018" id="u5a591018">时，该比值小于 1，因此显著权</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9b08ae6d9fed72562880f75720531bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kv3uP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub3014e22" id="ub3014e22">的相对量化误差将得到降低</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7b7fab3c" id="u7b7fab3c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u36184da1" id="u36184da1">同时考虑显著权重和非显著权重的量化误差，作者选择自动搜索一个逐输入通道的最优缩放因子，使某一层量化前后的输出差异最小。其优化目标可以为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc4d8a4cb" id="uc4d8a4cb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D%5E%7B*%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd14a56199af72191bbc59f8f86b2759.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eQrdT%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u80fbc338" id="u80fbc338" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20Q%5C%5Cleft(%20W%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D)%5E%7B-1%7DX%20%5C%5Cright)%20-%20WX%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1354c8b9a1c9c2c769a14b084ea78959.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZmQeB%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf7525ac0"><li fid="ud3594c4c" data-lake-id="ue20169a9" id="ue20169a9"><span data-lake-id="u907ac9dc" id="u907ac9dc">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RY2ma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5c7e6be" id="ud5c7e6be">表示权重量化函数，例如采用 group size 为 128 的 INT3 或 INT4 量化；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa36915ecf0b5605493f5aeaf1480a9ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f1blV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua51350ff" id="ua51350ff">表示原始 FP16 权重；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94e79ad0c1aabeafef9e2fc4af6adf66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EQ7QZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc51ef898" id="uc51ef898">表示从一个较小校准集上缓存得到的输入特征；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F11c29aa2bd829865b10c13fef844ef08.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fGkGc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73f97aec" id="u73f97aec">为逐输入通道的缩放因子。</span></li><li fid="ud3594c4c" data-lake-id="u4a4fd7c1" id="u4a4fd7c1"><span data-lake-id="u9cd34a15" id="u9cd34a15">对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D)%5E%7B-1%7DX%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3cd7633808f35091c1d1c28b8baff558.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RyZVu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb69a253" id="ubb69a253">中的缩放操作，通常可以将其融合到前一个算子中，因此不会引入额外的运行时计算开销。由于量化函数本身不可微，因此无法直接使用标准反向传播优化上述目标。虽然可以采用近似梯度方法，但作者发现这类方法仍然存在收敛不稳定的问题</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9ebe176c" id="u9ebe176c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4975a949" id="u4975a949">激活感知的搜索空间：为提高搜索过程的稳定性，作者根据影响缩放因子选择的因素，进一步定义一个简化搜索空间。由于权重通道的重要性实际上由对应的激活尺度决定，因此作者将缩放因子定义为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D_%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F601a2fe17ccdfc8b7a4bae5c5829d78c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cwuab%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uec5db1da" id="uec5db1da">并搜索最优的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18d25ca4f77a9bbed9812e2bb0b350a5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yi5u1%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub35bc4ba" id="ub35bc4ba" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%5E%7B*%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D_%7BX%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e7ccc1227343179e1a0de965b2ec7df.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AHlgZ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1dd69d98"><li fid="u9440af70" data-lake-id="uf2442aea" id="uf2442aea"><span data-lake-id="ue52ba31f" id="ue52ba31f">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D_%7BX%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c6e3c770899baade918df6999f330ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RS2vj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73c80876" id="u73c80876">表示逐通道激活平均幅值，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18d25ca4f77a9bbed9812e2bb0b350a5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iOBlg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9fc45065" id="u9fc45065">是一个用于权衡显著通道与非显著通道保护程度的超参数。在区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B0%2C1%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12d16d9672fe55e37279ae7043b605de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R1isT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufaed9ba6" id="ufaed9ba6">内通过快速网格搜索寻找最优</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18d25ca4f77a9bbed9812e2bb0b350a5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wUi6j%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u9440af70" data-lake-id="u0ec49590" id="u0ec49590"><span data-lake-id="u55679df5" id="u55679df5">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b3435551431f0c7b771d2ccc5582662.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gyrbB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uebe4337f" id="uebe4337f">时，不对权重进行缩放；当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Calpha%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd9863d1ff9c99c0bb369356aeac833ce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nEbCd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u897d5332" id="u897d5332">时，则对应搜索空间中最激进的缩放方式。</span></li><li fid="u9440af70" data-lake-id="u2db854ac" id="u2db854ac"><span data-lake-id="u6c5e79f2" id="u6c5e79f2">AWQ 还进一步对权重进行 clipping，以最小化量化产生的 MSE 误差。实验表明，在 OPT 模型的 INT3-g128 量化设置下，AWQ 能够稳定优于简单的最近邻舍入量化，并在保持更高硬件效率的同时，取得与保留 1% FP16 权重的混合精度方法相近的性能</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u920822d9" id="u920822d9"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueb4d92c2" id="ueb4d92c2" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">AWQ 不依赖 GPTQ 等方法所采用的重构过程，也不依赖许多量化感知训练方法所需要的反向传播。由于 AWQ 仅需要从校准数据中统计逐通道平均激活幅值，因此对校准集的依赖程度较低，并能够降低对校准数据产生过拟合的风险。因此，该方法在量化过程中所需的数据量较少，同时能够更好地保留 LLM 在校准数据分布之外的知识与泛化能力</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="Ox8t2" id="Ox8t2" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9b479cb3" id="u9b479cb3">🦃</span><span data-lake-id="u7a185f27" id="u7a185f27" style="color: #000000"> </span><span data-lake-id="ub4363567" id="ub4363567">𝐓𝐈𝐍𝐘𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐓: 𝐌𝐀𝐏𝐏𝐈𝐍𝐆 𝐀𝐖𝐐 𝐎𝐍𝐓𝐎 𝐄𝐃𝐆𝐄 𝐏𝐋𝐀𝐓𝐅𝐎𝐑𝐌𝐒</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uccfc9735" id="uccfc9735"><strong><span data-lake-id="u68397975" id="u68397975">AWQ 能够显著降低 LLM 的模型规模。然而，要将 W4A16（4-bit 权重、16-bit 激活）量化所带来的理论内存节省转化为实际可测的性能提升，并非易事</span></strong></p><ul list="ud86da210"><li fid="u9049e473" data-lake-id="u70b3242a" id="u70b3242a"><span data-lake-id="u98a9b46a" id="u98a9b46a">以 SmoothQuant 等 W8A8 量化方法为例，其存储与计算采用相同的数据精度，因此反量化过程可以较为自然地融合到计算 kernel 的 epilogue 中。相比之下，W4A16 在内存访问与实际计算过程中采用不同的数据类型，因此，为获得更高的执行效率，反量化操作需要被集成到主要计算循环之中，这也带来额外的实现复杂度。</span></li><li fid="u9049e473" data-lake-id="ue448294b" id="ue448294b"><span data-lake-id="uf701bc4b" id="uf701bc4b">作者提出 TinyChat，一套面向 AWQ 模型推理的高效系统。TinyChat 使用 PyTorch 作为前端，并在后端利用设备特定的指令集，例如 CUDA/PTX、NEON 和 AVX</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9de93457" id="u9de93457" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790084135675-9e334577-fcff-46f2-bb19-76dfae5bc10f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9238b91d-f562-4a52-9e77-7c53343ceca%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u31ba87f9-7ae6-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1031%2C%22height%22%3A154%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A93600%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1435%2C%22originHeight%22%3A215%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22(4K4K)(11K.4K)(4K.11K)(432K)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1110%2C%22y%22%3A176%2C%22width%22%3A289%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SK-0X0F...0F(128-BITM%22%2C%22x%22%3A447%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A224%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PACKEDWEIGHTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1134%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22I%E5%8F%AB%3DPW%3E%3E4)%22%2C%22x%22%3A830%2C%22y%22%3A119%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UNTIMEUNPACKIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A584%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORIGINALWEIGHTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1137%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A151%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LO-P%26MASK%22%2C%22x%22%3A880%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REORDERINGOFTLINE%22%2C%22x%22%3A349%2C%22y%22%3A109%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2247239G489400%22%2C%22x%22%3A1169%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W17W1WI6%22%2C%22x%22%3A333%2C%22y%22%3A153%2C%22width%22%3A162%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1396%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A70%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORIGINAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A6%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WLOW0%22%2C%22x%22%3A565%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22900%22%2C%22x%22%3A1052%2C%22y%22%3A66%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEIGHTS%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A12%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2200248215%22%2C%22x%22%3A1065%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PACKED%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22954%22%2C%22x%22%3A1336%2C%22y%22%3A48%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEIGHTS%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A8%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22200%22%2C%22x%22%3A1053%2C%22y%22%3A36%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221172%22%2C%22x%22%3A1318%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220W%22%2C%22x%22%3A914%2C%22y%22%3A153%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHIH%22%2C%22x%22%3A570%2C%22y%22%3A151%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220W0%22%2C%22x%22%3A916%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W7%22%2C%22x%22%3A860%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W3W15W2V%22%2C%22x%22%3A156%2C%22y%22%3A154%2C%22width%22%3A215%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3E8BIT%22%2C%22x%22%3A213%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225%22%2C%22x%22%3A655%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22600%22%2C%22x%22%3A1052%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22300%22%2C%22x%22%3A1052%2C%22y%22%3A129%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A86%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.WW%22%2C%22x%22%3A417%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22x%22%3A1384%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22127%22%2C%22x%22%3A586%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W1%22%2C%22x%22%3A876%2C%22y%22%3A72%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3E4IT%22%2C%22x%22%3A190%2C%22y%22%3A37%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%B7%22%2C%22x%22%3A1392%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A45%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A835%2C%22y%22%3A154%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22157%22%2C%22x%22%3A602%2C%22y%22%3A180%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A518%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W15%22%2C%22x%22%3A345%2C%22y%22%3A72%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A985%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W30..%22%2C%22x%22%3A184%2C%22y%22%3A72%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%22%2C%22x%22%3A655%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23efeeec%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u37e5db7a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u191a74e9" id="u191a74e9"><span data-lake-id="ue687f367" id="ue687f367">在 GPU 上，TinyChat 仅针对推理过程中最关键的组件实现专用优化，包括 Attention、Layer Normalization 和 Linear Projection kernel。其前端保持较高的灵活性，以便快速适配新的模型结构。采用 4-bit AWQ 后，TinyChat 在多个 LLM 系列上相较 HuggingFace FP16 实现获得超过 3 倍的 GPU 推理加速。在 CPU 上，TinyChat 则将完整计算图下沉至 C++，以降低运行时开销</span></p><p data-lake-id="uedc25dc8" id="uedc25dc8"><span data-lake-id="u8606ea00" id="u8606ea00">对于量化层，由于硬件通常不直接提供 INT4 与 FP16 之间的乘法指令，因此在执行矩阵计算前，需要首先将 INT4 权重反量化至 FP16。为避免将反量化后的权重写回 DRAM，TinyChat 将</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5303b170" id="u5303b170">反量化操作直接融合到矩阵乘法 kernel 中</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua908df1d" id="ua908df1d">。权重在被读取后立即完成解包和反量化，并直接参与后续矩阵计算，而不是先生成完整的 FP16 权重矩阵并写回显存。这种融合方式同时应用于矩阵-矩阵乘法和矩阵-向量乘法 kernel</span></p><p data-lake-id="u81bee124" id="u81bee124"><span data-lake-id="u1ed67263" id="u1ed67263">SIMD 感知的权重打包，本质上是针对目标硬件的 SIMD 寄存器宽度，提前在离线阶段重新排列低比特权重，使运行时能够用少量向量指令一次性完成多个 INT4 权重的解包，而不是逐元素执行标量 shift 和 bitwise AND。其核心目的是让低比特权重的数据布局更适配目标设备的向量化执行方式，从而降低 INT4 解包开销并提升推理效率</span></p><p data-lake-id="u951cb6a8" id="u951cb6a8"><span data-lake-id="u2a1f725f" id="u2a1f725f">TinyChat 还广泛采用 kernel fusion 来优化端侧 LLM 推理。对于 Layer Normalization，作者将乘法、除法以及平方根等操作融合到单个 kernel 中执行，从而减少中间结果读写以及 kernel launch 开销。对于 Attention 层，TinyChat 将 Q、K、V 三个 projection 融合到一个 kernel 中，同时在运行过程中直接计算位置编码。此外，TinyChat 会预先分配 KV Cache，并在 Attention kernel 内部直接完成 Cache 更新。这种 kernel fusion 对于 Falcon 和 StarCoder 等 forward 实现效率较低的模型尤为有效</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="p3y0O" id="p3y0O" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9570e579" id="u9570e579">🌀</span><span data-lake-id="ufe9a22d9" id="ufe9a22d9"> 𝐒𝐩𝐢𝐧𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ua505241a" id="ua505241a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u20039b79" id="u20039b79">针对权重、激活值以及键值缓存的训练后量化（Post-Training Quantization，PTQ）技术，能够显著降低大语言模型的内存占用、推理延迟与功耗。然而，当模型中存在异常值时，低比特量化通常会引入较大的量化误差</span></strong></p><ul list="u22ede0bb"><li fid="u7efc21bd" data-lake-id="uf8d872d5" id="uf8d872d5"><span data-lake-id="ua35756ac" id="ua35756ac">已有研究主要通过两类方式缓解这一问题。一类方法在权重和激活值之间重新分配量化难度；另一类方法则采用混合精度表示，对异常值进行单独处理</span></li><li fid="u7efc21bd" data-lake-id="u27e4a759" id="u27e4a759"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufdadbed9" id="ufdadbed9" style="color: #2A4200">从新的角度研究异常值问题：通过为权重矩阵和激活矩阵引入旋转变换，削弱异常值并改善张量的量化友好性</span></strong></li><li fid="u7efc21bd" data-lake-id="uaf369510" id="uaf369510"><span data-lake-id="u62fbe253" id="u62fbe253">受 Elhage et al. 和 SliceGPT 的启发，本文利用神经网络中的旋转不变性，从恒等映射中构造成对出现的旋转矩阵。由于这些旋转矩阵可以被吸收到相邻的权重矩阵中，因此不会改变模型整体的函数映射和全精度输出。应用随机旋转后，权重或激活值中的元素通常能够形成更加均匀、异常值更少的数值分布，从而降低低比特量化的难度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u00da9b8c" id="u00da9b8c"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3ce9f95" id="ua3ce9f95">尽管随机旋转在统计意义上通常能够改善模型的量化性能，但实验表明，不同旋转矩阵对应的量化效果可能存在较大差异。例如，在零样本推理任务上，不同随机旋转矩阵所得到的平均准确率差距最高可达 13 个百分点</span></strong></p><ul list="u3b758521"><li fid="uf953c1ce" data-lake-id="uf06507e1" id="uf06507e1"><span data-lake-id="uef3f5dd7" id="uef3f5dd7">随机选择旋转矩阵并不能充分发挥旋转变换的潜力。基于这一观察，本文提出 SpinQuant，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uac79e9d8" id="uac79e9d8" style="color: #DF2A3F">一种通过学习旋转矩阵来优化量化网络精度的新型方法。SpinQuant 在冻结预训练模型权重的情况下，直接优化旋转矩阵，使旋转后的权重与中间激活值更加适合低比特表示</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u07f9b7c3" id="u07f9b7c3"><span data-lake-id="u3e3eaddc" id="u3e3eaddc">在优化过程中，预训练模型的原始权重保持固定，仅更新旋转矩阵。为保证旋转矩阵始终满足正交约束，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5fddd58d" id="u5fddd58d" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">SpinQuant 采用 Cayley-SGD，在 Stiefel 流形上优化旋转参数。该优化过程不会改变全精度模型的输出，而是通过重新组织模型内部权重和激活值的数值分布，使中间表示更加适合低比特量化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u26d7a039" id="u26d7a039"><span data-lake-id="u831989b3" id="u831989b3">针对不同的计算复杂度与量化精度需求，SpinQuant 提出两种旋转策略：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0aaa44f2" id="u0aaa44f2">SpinQuant-no-had 和 SpinQuant-had</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u09a24c51" id="u09a24c51" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1784987161819-be3bd625-3684-46ee-9dd5-b2e0657b1d8b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u97dce006-15c5-43d2-91c7-77a09baad82%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uabe6895e-406a-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A789%2C%22height%22%3A304%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A205927%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1176%2C%22originHeight%22%3A453%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22EDUCEOUTLIERSINSIDETHEBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A161%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A266%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2CREDUCEOUTLIERSINSIDETHEBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A754%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A258%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%86M%22%2C%22x%22%3A591%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GUANTIZEWEIGHTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A752%2C%22y%22%3A410%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MULTI-HEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SELF-ATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A357%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUANTIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A410%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUANTIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A477%2C%22y%22%3A411%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEEDFORWARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A698%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MERGEAND%22%2C%22x%22%3A750%2C%22y%22%3A388%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AROTATIONS%22%2C%22x%22%3A181%2C%22y%22%3A411%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A267%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTWHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A1005%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K-VCACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A386%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTIVATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A944%2C%22y%22%3A409%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTIVATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A474%2C%22y%22%3A388%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACTIVATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A1078%2C%22y%22%3A410%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROTATIONS%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A411%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTMAX%22%2C%22x%22%3A315%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDINGW%22%2C%22x%22%3A39%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NETWORK%22%2C%22x%22%3A709%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORIGINAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1078%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%40R%22%2C%22x%22%3A199%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A1037%2C%22y%22%3A216%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MERGEABLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A388%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WDOUWM%22%2C%22x%22%3A1027%2C%22y%22%3A242%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WOATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A727%2C%22y%22%3A270%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROTATED%22%2C%22x%22%3A945%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22x%22%3A568%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%40R%22%2C%22x%22%3A556%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONLINE%22%2C%22x%22%3A198%2C%22y%22%3A387%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22x%22%3A1107%2C%22y%22%3A309%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROPEF%22%2C%22x%22%3A146%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROPER%22%2C%22x%22%3A135%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B)%22%2C%22x%22%3A575%2C%22y%22%3A309%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SWISH%22%2C%22x%22%3A820%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RW%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22W%22%2C%22x%22%3A742%2C%22y%22%3A202%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1%22%2C%22x%22%3A1080%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R3%22%2C%22x%22%3A157%2C%22y%22%3A372%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A64%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R1%22%2C%22x%22%3A836%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R3%22%2C%22x%22%3A694%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A168%2C%22y%22%3A386%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R4%22%2C%22x%22%3A901%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R%22%2C%22x%22%3A635%2C%22y%22%3A41%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R4%22%2C%22x%22%3A164%2C%22y%22%3A409%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A628%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R%22%2C%22x%22%3A189%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%BDA%22%2C%22x%22%3A438%2C%22y%22%3A381%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R%E4%BA%861%22%2C%22x%22%3A295%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf8f6%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uc75de94d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub74b2fd1" id="ub74b2fd1"><strong><span data-lake-id="uac58e073" id="uac58e073">SpinQuant-no-had 主要包含</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F91d0164eb56d754c681b6836351f26eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rYSJ6%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u911181d1" id="u911181d1">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xgi5C%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u700e5cf9" id="u700e5cf9">两类旋转</span></strong></p><ul list="uaf97d047"><li fid="u1ec810d8" data-lake-id="u1184fa8f" id="u1184fa8f"><span data-lake-id="ua1f6a662" id="ua1f6a662">这两类旋转矩阵均可直接吸收到对应的预训练权重矩阵中。在模型推理阶段，只需使用经过旋转和量化后的权重替换原始权重，无须修改模型的前向传播过程，也不会引入额外的在线旋转计算</span></li><li fid="u1ec810d8" data-lake-id="u876e49f1" id="u876e49f1"><span data-lake-id="ue5229497" id="ue5229497">SpinQuant-no-had 在保持原始网络结构和推理流程不变的同时，能够有效改善模型权重及层间激活值的量化特性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u68579638" id="u68579638"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ff7fc8e" id="u8ff7fc8e">SpinQuant-had 主要面向激活值或 KV Cache 采用极低比特量化的场景，例如 4 比特量化</span></strong></p><ul list="u321163c2"><li fid="ueac582bb" data-lake-id="uf99f015e" id="uf99f015e"><span data-lake-id="u747f9a93" id="u747f9a93">除</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F91d0164eb56d754c681b6836351f26eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X8v74%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uedccf8fd" id="uedccf8fd">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe476e3afcce9b01bf236a200099b8e12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22po8fM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3bc0338" id="uf3bc0338">之外，SpinQuant-had 进一步引入在线 Hadamard 旋转矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda6fb24836e26265addcd045f38dd5ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FE2V7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue67747fb" id="ue67747fb">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b3df3e42ed893f993f851a75b170eff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fFYyb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u236114ee" id="u236114ee">，分别用于处理多层感知机模块内部的激活异常值，以及 KV Cache 中的异常值问题</span></li><li fid="ueac582bb" data-lake-id="u03ba6b90" id="u03ba6b90"><span data-lake-id="u66f0f1ef" id="u66f0f1ef">与完全吸收到权重中的离线旋转不同，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d1ee1635466effb6bf6949892e750b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZbfnL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1054b49" id="ue1054b49">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b3df3e42ed893f993f851a75b170eff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M5171%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u26406caa" id="u26406caa">需要在推理过程中在线执行。然而，Hadamard 变换具有结构化和计算复杂度较低等特点，因此能够以较小的计算开销显著改善激活值与 KV Cache 的数值分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u83a7befd" id="u83a7befd"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf13d393d" id="uf13d393d" style="color: #70000D">通过联合使用可学习的离线旋转和结构化在线 Hadamard 旋转，SpinQuant 能够有效控制权重、激活值以及 KV Cache 在极低比特量化条件下产生的误差，并显著提高量化大语言模型的推理精度</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="LZHiz" id="LZHiz" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7f354008" id="u7f354008">🚀</span><span data-lake-id="u49fcea46" id="u49fcea46"> 𝐌𝐎𝐓𝐈𝐕𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u2116ba16" id="u2116ba16"><strong><span data-lake-id="u782ac15c" id="u782ac15c">量化通过降低神经网络中权重或激活值的数值精度，以减少模型的内存占用并降低推理延迟。量化过程可以表示为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u7c424311" id="u7c424311" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_Q%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clfloor%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BX_R-%5C%5Cbeta%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crceil%20%2B%5C%5Cbeta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd2279d2a8923f221d3a195da961e1db0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M47um%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc2400783"><li fid="u31233345" data-lake-id="u413f2b77" id="u413f2b77"><span data-lake-id="u06f34d36" id="u06f34d36">在对称量化中</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufa407363" id="ufa407363" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmax%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cleft%7CX_R%5C%5Cright%7C%5C%5Cright)%7D%20%7B2%5E%7BN-1%7D-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cbeta%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff496dbd8a2bf0ef55b37ac24febc71af.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e9eSc%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u66e3548d"><li fid="u60fa35de" data-lake-id="u3dd06194" id="u3dd06194"><span data-lake-id="u3a14fde1" id="u3a14fde1">在非对称量化中</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ueec5a358" id="ueec5a358" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmax(X_R)-%5C%5Cmin(X_R)%7D%20%7B2%5EN-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cbeta%3D%5C%5Cmin(X_R)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb838a39001a4c9ce9452e9872ddb33f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lkRdk%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uace2c406"><li fid="ucc0be17a" data-lake-id="u8db531ce" id="u8db531ce"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc80af60c363a10d0da2da92626e309aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uLLNg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89c7631b" id="u89c7631b">表示量化后的张量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X_R%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd737ed984023eb426078dd5206c8ab82.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TSSmU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud925bc39" id="ud925bc39">表示采用 FP16 格式存储的实值张量，N 表示量化位宽</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8a6f24bb" id="u8a6f24bb"><span data-lake-id="u30ed4457" id="u30ed4457">对于大语言模型，异常值的存在会显著扩大权重或激活值的数值范围，从而增加普通数值的重构误差。本文提出采用经过优化的旋转变换来削弱异常值。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u53874d32" id="u53874d32">直观而言，随机旋转矩阵能够在统计意义上将幅值较大与较小的权重分量进行混合，使其形成异常值更少、数值分布更加规则的表示，从而降低量化难度</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u52a09182" id="u52a09182" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1784988002999-8152138e-d299-454a-a6c5-ad579d72cbf0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubc7cef83-c03d-4097-8ae8-773997406cc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u7ac4987d-315f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A794%2C%22height%22%3A204%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A107495%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1332%2C%22originHeight%22%3A342%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A462%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A225%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BEFOREROTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A230%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A128%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AFTERROTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A1206%2C%22y%22%3A52%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BEFOREROTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A772%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AFTERROTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A231%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYER1D%22%2C%22x%22%3A230%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22751001251%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A259%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FTERROTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A774%2C%22y%22%3A143%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A451%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A197%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AYERLD%22%2C%22x%22%3A670%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B9%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A373%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A95%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AYERLD%22%2C%22x%22%3A1109%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.40%22%2C%22x%22%3A904%2C%22y%22%3A34%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22x%22%3A235%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22x%22%3A1112%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.35%22%2C%22x%22%3A907%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.3%22%2C%22x%22%3A909%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22x%22%3A676%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A519%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A4%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E9%22%2C%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NM%22%2C%22x%22%3A765%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A902%2C%22y%22%3A138%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A126%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A81%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f9%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2d37828d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud20ebc1b"><li fid="ucbe87198" data-lake-id="u6b10638d" id="u6b10638d"><span data-lake-id="ub87948cc" id="ub87948cc">峰度用于衡量实值随机变量概率分布的尾部特性。较大的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ckappa%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd12014c7697fc976c5d8ea02bd692191.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sQ9Ca%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u62a4573c" id="u62a4573c">通常意味着分布中存在更多异常值，而当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ckappa%20%5C%5Capprox%203%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F65799baafb536df544ce292e30eaab23.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oMONl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5d01812" id="ua5d01812">时，通常表明该分布接近高斯分布</span></li><li fid="ucbe87198" data-lake-id="u64e368a6" id="u64e368a6"><span data-lake-id="u6487dc76" id="u6487dc76">Transformer 中原始激活值分布包含大量异常值，许多层的峰度甚至超过 200。将激活值与随机旋转矩阵相乘后，所有层的峰度均下降至约 3。这说明旋转后的激活值呈现出更加接近高斯分布的形态，因此更适合进行低比特量化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf7a6abe0" id="uf7a6abe0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub7c279bd" id="ub7c279bd">尽管随机旋转在统计意义上通常能够改善量化性能，但并非所有随机旋转矩阵都会产生相同的量化结果</span></strong></p><ul list="uef8c0f96"><li fid="ua9f6c4bd" data-lake-id="uc6a6c04a" id="uc6a6c04a"><span data-lake-id="u4d96fe08" id="u4d96fe08">研究人员对 LLaMA-2 7B 模型进行 100 次随机实验。每次实验均采用不同的随机旋转矩阵，并将模型的权重和激活值同时量化至 4 比特，即 W4A4 配置，随后评估模型在零样本任务上的平均准确率。不同随机旋转矩阵所对应的模型性能存在显著差异。其中，最佳随机旋转矩阵所得到的平均准确率比最差随机旋转矩阵高出 13 个百分点</span></li><li fid="ua9f6c4bd" data-lake-id="u723491a0" id="u723491a0"><span data-lake-id="u9473be17" id="u9473be17">随机 Hadamard 矩阵的整体表现优于一般的随机旋转矩阵。Hadamard 矩阵能够对旋转后权重的最大幅值给出更加紧致的上界。然而，即使采用随机 Hadamard 旋转矩阵，模型最终性能仍然存在不可忽略的波动，其准确率差异最高可达 6 个百分点</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf7668221" id="uf7668221"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3ab4146" id="ub3ab4146" style="color: #DF2A3F">鉴于不同旋转矩阵在多次实验中表现出巨大的性能方差，一个自然的问题是：能否直接优化旋转矩阵，从而最大化旋转变换对量化性能的提升作用？</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="JswB0" id="JswB0" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u65a953f4" id="u65a953f4">🐢</span><span data-lake-id="ubfcb94c6" id="ubfcb94c6"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucf55b19d" id="ucf55b19d">𝐑𝐎𝐓𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍 𝐏𝐀𝐑𝐀𝐌𝐄𝐓𝐄𝐑𝐈𝐙𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="ue40c207b" id="ue40c207b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u416b41ea" id="u416b41ea">本节介绍 SpinQuant，一种面向量化损失、在大语言模型中引入并优化旋转变换的量化框架</span></strong></p><ul list="ub459f847"><li fid="u5513fb3c" data-lake-id="u38dfd9cd" id="u38dfd9cd"><span data-lake-id="u87199bab" id="u87199bab">针对主流大语言模型架构定义一组旋转参数化形式，包括两个可被合并至权重矩阵中的旋转矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c1fd819f40f538cc45d3b543c7a4007.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pkRxT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u12c9e439" id="u12c9e439">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe476e3afcce9b01bf236a200099b8e12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k3Mo3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua6b12c11" id="ua6b12c11">。这两种旋转能够保证全精度网络的函数映射保持不变</span></li><li fid="u5513fb3c" data-lake-id="ufe567dfd" id="ufe567dfd"><span data-lake-id="ubb432e0a" id="ubb432e0a">引入两个需要在线计算的 Hadamard 旋转</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda6fb24836e26265addcd045f38dd5ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OsKFP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f39d141" id="u7f39d141">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b3df3e42ed893f993f851a75b170eff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vKymK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b8487e2" id="u8b8487e2">，以进一步抑制激活值与 KV Cache 在极低比特量化条件下的异常值</span></li><li fid="u5513fb3c" data-lake-id="u1ef23f9d" id="u1ef23f9d"><span data-lake-id="uc097a003" id="uc097a003">介绍如何以量化网络的目标损失为优化目标，在 Stiefel 流形上对这些旋转矩阵进行联合优化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uce7cf31f" id="uce7cf31f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6fe84e81" id="u6fe84e81">残差路径中的激活旋转：将嵌入层输出</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62721e230a6b8ef4402a375c7f1b82a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lSUuL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub578bca6" id="ub578bca6">与一个随机旋转矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F91d0164eb56d754c681b6836351f26eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QoJSx%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u61fe107e" id="u61fe107e">相乘，从而对残差路径中的激活值进行旋转。该旋转能够减少异常值，并降低从残差路径读取输入的全连接层对输入激活值进行量化的难度</span></strong></p><ul list="u3d61879c"><li fid="u578b01b7" data-lake-id="u2435075b" id="u2435075b"><span data-lake-id="u348ccf90" id="u348ccf90">在旋转后的激活值进入包含非线性运算的注意力模块和前馈网络之前，乘以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%5E%7BT%7D%EF%BC%88%3DR_1%5E%7B-1%7D%EF%BC%89%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7be9e6b2dd3b56b5acbce93f6fd0165e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v7skq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7ff40e88" id="u7ff40e88">，以执行逆旋转。在不存在量化的情况下，无论采用何种旋转，全精度网络均保持不变</span></li><li fid="u578b01b7" data-lake-id="u41bf1d40" id="u41bf1d40"><span data-lake-id="u90598418" id="u90598418">这些旋转矩阵可以合并到相应的权重矩阵中。完成吸收后，网络中不会引入新的参数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0e9ac16a" id="u0e9ac16a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u588fa501" id="u588fa501">注意力模块中的激活旋转：在注意力模块中，通过乘以</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe476e3afcce9b01bf236a200099b8e12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22in9VA%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc60ea11" id="ucc60ea11">对 Value 矩阵进行旋转，并以注意力头为单位，将输出投影层的输入激活值乘以</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_2%5ET%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F36371836efee1f93126097a867cf3387.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jU6Mn%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u81bf68ea"><li fid="u0faa3045" data-lake-id="u6e711270" id="u6e711270"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22salL9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ccc7006" id="u0ccc7006">的形状为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bhead%7D%7D%2C%20D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bhead%7D%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6a59a40f4ba29de10f46df82e40daa3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lyJpk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9487bc5" id="ua9487bc5">，并且不同网络层可以独立选择各自的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W0MIW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf51a41b7" id="uf51a41b7">。由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XFZXy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u98629b4b" id="u98629b4b">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%5ET%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1f7d56ff78c730376cb9f5fd5607dfb4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cuhK7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua0e40c31" id="ua0e40c31">之间不存在其他算子，因此这两个旋转可以在全精度网络中相互抵消</span></li><li fid="u0faa3045" data-lake-id="u0585404a" id="u0585404a"><span data-lake-id="uaccdf2c8" id="uaccdf2c8">该旋转能够改善 Value Cache 和输出投影层输入激活值的量化效果，并且不会向网络中引入任何新的参数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaa1c75f6" id="uaa1c75f6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u34b4c657" id="u34b4c657">额外的未吸收旋转：为在更低比特的激活值量化场景中，例如 4 比特量化，进一步增强对异常值的抑制能力，在前馈网络模块内部引入 Hadamard 矩阵乘法，即</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b3df3e42ed893f993f851a75b170eff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qcs6m%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8be62a9" id="ud8be62a9">，以减少下投影层输入激活值中的异常值</span></strong></p><ul list="ub33dd9cf"><li fid="ud481813d" data-lake-id="u91f4c086" id="u91f4c086"><span data-lake-id="u84d822a5" id="u84d822a5">Hadamard 旋转可以使用快速 Hadamard 变换进行计算，因此仅会给推理延迟带来很小的额外开销。类似地，当需要进行低比特 KV Cache 量化时，也可以插入 Hadamard 矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda6fb24836e26265addcd045f38dd5ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G1JcY%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue2b50117" id="ue2b50117"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc9f4138b" id="uc9f4138b">将同时使用全部旋转矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F91d0164eb56d754c681b6836351f26eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dy5Jv%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaef7795c" id="uaef7795c">、</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qdhyc%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ff053c0" id="u8ff053c0">、</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d1ee1635466effb6bf6949892e750b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xw4DO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uab841320" id="uab841320">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F16431477028e0f565492157004921e2a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IWsEv%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3cb67cda" id="u3cb67cda">的完整方法记为 SpinQuant-had</span></strong></p><ul list="u0e058e17"><li fid="uc29ba9c4" data-lake-id="u0253e5f6" id="u0253e5f6"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F91d0164eb56d754c681b6836351f26eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y07dl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1362d96e" id="u1362d96e">：作用于残差流的全局可学习旋转，可合并至权重</span></li><li fid="uc29ba9c4" data-lake-id="u8f9ad14d" id="u8f9ad14d"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WSm7X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63048293" id="u63048293">：作用于每个注意力头 Value 通道的可学习旋转，可合并至权重</span></li><li fid="uc29ba9c4" data-lake-id="u15e18e45" id="u15e18e45"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F48d1ee1635466effb6bf6949892e750b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xv7XG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60cba09d" id="u60cba09d">：面向低比特 KV Cache 量化的在线 Hadamard 旋转</span></li><li fid="uc29ba9c4" data-lake-id="u13d4b655" id="u13d4b655"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b3df3e42ed893f993f851a75b170eff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22njWIG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6504107d" id="u6504107d">：面向前馈网络内部低比特激活量化的在线 Hadamard 旋转</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u98ad6180" id="u98ad6180"><strong><span data-lake-id="u00f03168" id="u00f03168">引入四个旋转矩阵可以在保持全精度网络数值一致性的同时提升量化性能。由于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda6fb24836e26265addcd045f38dd5ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a1Wcs%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b5beeed" id="u6b5beeed">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F16431477028e0f565492157004921e2a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ap99R%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u79c58fde" id="u79c58fde">属于在线旋转操作，即无法被吸收到权重矩阵中，因此将其保留为 Hadamard 矩阵。因为在线 Hadamard 变换可以被高效实现，而不会引入显著的额外开销。优化目标定义为：寻找最优的旋转矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20R_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c1fd819f40f538cc45d3b543c7a4007.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ShvO1%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u402878a6" id="u402878a6">和 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff159e7f89fbb97da7221eb80b51d9dbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GEDRS%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u04d440a9" id="u04d440a9">，使量化网络的最终损失最小</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2e13acf0" id="u2e13acf0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cunderset%7BR%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin%7D%5C%5C%3B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BQ%7D(R_1%2CR_2%5C%5Cmid%20W%2CX).%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4d888ff3d7d003b2a9bc65647d00238f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xbFb6%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u46d4ae57"><li fid="u2b267f5c" data-lake-id="uebd0f699" id="uebd0f699"><span data-lake-id="uc11f256a" id="uc11f256a">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76389b5c1663c1de7d1d054779306ade.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XtOTE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd051284" id="ubd051284">表示 Stiefel 流形，即所有正交矩阵构成的集合。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BQ%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f9decc4f120c9878764ab62d271601b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hzf9s%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2646fa42" id="u2646fa42">表示在校准集上计算的任务损失，例如交叉熵损失。在预训练权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa36915ecf0b5605493f5aeaf1480a9ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Beu1V%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d6afd80" id="u8d6afd80">和输入张量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62721e230a6b8ef4402a375c7f1b82a0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EGZ2M%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30bc6fb9" id="u30bc6fb9">固定，并且网络中包含量化函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F27fc9cac17259612f01ac1f42db6120b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G1FCR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e9cd4af" id="u7e9cd4af">的情况下，损失是关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7BR_1%2CR_2%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7025c65ce1638dc6d6a5d724ec9d2e27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vKpuT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9365c98c" id="u9365c98c">的函数</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="AKD9m" id="AKD9m" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u132f8525" id="u132f8525">🦞</span><span data-lake-id="ue6c9cd81" id="ue6c9cd81"> 𝐂𝐚𝐲𝐥𝐞𝐲-𝐎𝐏𝐓𝐈𝐌𝐈𝐙𝐄𝐃 𝐑𝐎𝐓𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uf37b698b" id="uf37b698b"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufc033dfc" id="ufc033dfc">为在 Stiefel 流形上优化旋转矩阵，采用 Cayley SGD 方法。该方法是一种用于 Stiefel 流形优化的高效算法。更具体地，在每次迭代中，旋转矩阵 R 的更新被参数化为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc1688d65" id="uc1688d65" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R'%20%3D%20%5C%5CDelta_R(Y)R%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(I-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%7B2%7DY%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(I%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%7B2%7DY%5C%5Cright)R%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd189b41dbfbce623423dafa60e78e2bb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NOvhi%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u06b27cc0"><li fid="u2af80b20" data-lake-id="u4c911ba1" id="u4c911ba1"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta_R(Y)%3A%3D%5C%5Cleft(I-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%7B2%7DY%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cleft(I%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%7B2%7DY%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c0766a0fa8a003114eb2e8ee49fba95.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z5rKA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3916676b" id="u3916676b">表示反对称矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6204886f5cc39a4b860ea98a7e95af1d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hWMb2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u573a0e60" id="u573a0e60">的 Cayley 变换，并且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%5E%5C%5Ctop%3D-Y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09ff0edbe9e3da79ae165ea2140c1797.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UKSdg%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u2af80b20" data-lake-id="ud9e1ce5d" id="ud9e1ce5d"><span data-lake-id="uf0067290" id="uf0067290">矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe0bfa106d98c3b7b8e9bfd6c70cb5b65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zBO9X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2b65dd4d" id="u2b65dd4d">由损失函数梯度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22G%3A%3D%5C%5Cnabla_R%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7BQ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F175b39140a7139a4a85bdcdeaea04891.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g0qyf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf76308a" id="ucf76308a">的投影</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ca4488d5151952c252f25711f1ed562.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vMEBh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue2c3da06" id="ue2c3da06">计算得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufad7ea29" id="ufad7ea29" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3D%5C%5Chat%7BG%7D-%5C%5Chat%7BG%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Chat%7BG%7D%20%3A%3D%20GR%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7DRR%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7DGR%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D.%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F70e8d87983ce70c70419c59b0b4b9494.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HdkLd%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u63b21755"><li fid="u33e02383" data-lake-id="u7b6254e8" id="u7b6254e8"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta_R(Y)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb534e80f69e039792b05c756f19c47f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bNPHM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce745493" id="uce745493">始终是正交矩阵。因此，只要 R 是正交矩阵，更新后的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R'%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40996f19815d510ff7593c8788cacca4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qayhf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u51a595c3" id="u51a595c3">也能够保证满足正交性，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R'%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7DR'%3DI%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd56c43c1f734fa6612c71f9dcba4ff9f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iwESA%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u33e02383" data-lake-id="u694b1d17" id="u694b1d17"><span data-lake-id="ubc2b7581" id="ubc2b7581">尽管涉及矩阵求逆，但新的旋转矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R'%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40996f19815d510ff7593c8788cacca4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QhCBm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57f18519" id="u57f18519">可以通过高效的定点迭代方法进行计算。与朴素 SGD 算法相比，该方法仅需约 2 倍的单次迭代计算时间，即可始终保持旋转矩阵的正交性质</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua55c4b19" id="ua55c4b19"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e8c2dc7" id="u6e8c2dc7">采用 Cayley SGD 方法求解</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7BR_1%2CR_2%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7025c65ce1638dc6d6a5d724ec9d2e27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aVBpl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc3338d7f" id="uc3338d7f">，同时冻结网络底层的权重参数。</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7BR_1%2CR_2%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7025c65ce1638dc6d6a5d724ec9d2e27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aIxJa%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u124e4cb1" id="u124e4cb1">的参数规模仅约占模型权重规模的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220.26%5C%5C%25%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F74cc2f96a181a698bab69c14d5d5b35a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zBfNo%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u57c19c85" id="u57c19c85">，并且受到正交性约束。因此，底层浮点网络保持不变，旋转操作只会影响模型的量化性能</span></strong></p><ul list="ufaf4ff9b"><li fid="u81a3e67c" data-lake-id="u5c63fba4" id="u5c63fba4"><span data-lake-id="ue3b26f4a" id="ue3b26f4a">当采用不同随机种子进行初始化时，经 Cayley 优化得到的旋转矩阵表现出极小的性能方差。在优化开始时，使用随机 Hadamard 矩阵对旋转矩阵进行初始化。消融实验进一步表明，即使采用随机旋转矩阵进行初始化，优化后的旋转矩阵同样具有较强的稳健性</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="nWDCe" id="nWDCe" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u9975a1f0" id="u9975a1f0">🐧</span><span data-lake-id="u2199886c" id="u2199886c"> 𝐅𝐋𝐀𝐓𝐐𝐔𝐀𝐍𝐓: 𝐅𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐧𝐞𝐬𝐬 𝐌𝐚𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐬 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐋𝐋𝐌 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u5d306178" id="u5d306178"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf2e2b013" id="uf2e2b013" style="color: #663000">量化通过降低模型参数和激活值的数值精度，从而减少模型的内存占用并加速推理过程。量化误差通常被用作衡量量化方法性能的重要指标。影响量化误差的一个关键因素是权重和激活分布的平坦性</span></strong></p><ul list="u3f9896fa"><li fid="u458d492d" data-lake-id="ua9387c12" id="ua9387c12"><span data-lake-id="u6602ba44" id="u6602ba44">直观而言，当权重或激活的分布较为尖锐，并且存在多个远离主体分布的数值时，将这些数值映射至相同的量化值通常会产生较大的量化误差</span></li><li fid="u458d492d" data-lake-id="uf65af87d" id="uf65af87d"><span data-lake-id="u4acbb091" id="u4acbb091">由于 LLM 的计算结果需要逐层经过 Transformer 网络传播，因此，降低量化误差也有助于减缓误差在 Transformer 层间的传播与累积</span></li><li fid="u458d492d" data-lake-id="u89047b00" id="u89047b00"><span data-lake-id="u4cfa0a95" id="u4cfa0a95">LLM 的激活中往往存在极端离群值，同时还存在所谓的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucbdb77a0" id="ucbdb77a0">枢轴 Token（Pivot Tokens）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8455dcf3" id="u8455dcf3">。为缓解这一问题，已有大量工作提出在量化之前引入不同的变换，以削弱离群值所带来的影响</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u199746ef" id="u199746ef"><strong><span data-lake-id="u83abc7a3" id="u83abc7a3" style="color: #663000">作者重新审视这些变换方法后发现，它们在提升分布平坦性方面仍然存在不足</span></strong></p><ul list="uf8a53296"><li fid="u7cfa801b" data-lake-id="u320c0c7a" id="u320c0c7a"><span data-lake-id="u28dacbde" id="u28dacbde">逐通道缩放（Per-channel Scaling）旨在平衡权重与激活之间的离群值，但难以进一步将离群值分散至其他非离群通道</span></li><li fid="u7cfa801b" data-lake-id="ue300e8b5" id="ue300e8b5"><span data-lake-id="u8c6dd252" id="u8c6dd252">近期提出的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ff0fdbf" id="u5ff0fdbf">Hadamard 变换</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u695efc85" id="u695efc85">试图解决这一问题，但该方法并未充分考虑不同线性层自身的特性</span></li><li fid="u7cfa801b" data-lake-id="u42190013" id="u42190013"><span data-lake-id="u37be41f9" id="u37be41f9">此外，这些方法所引入的线性变换不可避免地会产生额外的推理开销，从而影响量化所能够带来的整体推理加速效果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue65ed92a" id="ue65ed92a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u39ca2974" id="u39ca2974" style="color: #AD1A2B">FLATQUANT 的目标是为每一个线性层寻找最优的仿射变换，并利用校准数据（Calibration Data），通过一种轻量级的逐块训练策略对这些变换进行优化。为降低仿射变换所带来的推理开销，FLATQUANT 利用两个轻量级矩阵构造高效的 Kronecker 积变换，从而同时降低额外的内存需求和计算开销</span></strong></p><ul list="uf9821083"><li fid="u36404897" data-lake-id="u32445ef5" id="u32445ef5"><span data-lake-id="u2ed5f116" id="u2ed5f116">该方法能够与多种量化技术兼容，例如</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3334867a" id="u3334867a">可学习截断（Learnable Clipping）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucf8e248d" id="ucf8e248d">，同时也可以应用于多种量化场景，包括仅权重量化</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5b600d02" id="u5b600d02">和 KV Cache 量化</span></strong></li><li fid="u36404897" data-lake-id="u4038aca7" id="u4038aca7"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucdde4512" id="ucdde4512">由于 FLATQUANT 所引入的仿射变换本质上属于</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc7f4c4c2" id="uc7f4c4c2">内存受限操作，作者进一步将仿射变换与量化操作融合至单个计算 Kernel 中，从而减少全局内存访问以及 Kernel 启动开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u582286e0" id="u582286e0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7fb91683" id="u7fb91683">主要贡献总结如下</span></strong></p><ul list="u2c325caf"><li fid="u9281e33d" data-lake-id="u09442687" id="u09442687"><span data-lake-id="uef957738" id="uef957738">强调</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u957cc016" id="u957cc016">分布平坦性对于 LLM 量化的重要性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub11138d8" id="ub11138d8">，表明更加平坦的权重和激活分布有助于降低量化难度，减轻量化误差在 Transformer 各层之间的传播与累积 </span></li><li fid="u9281e33d" data-lake-id="uc9e10d4f" id="uc9e10d4f"><span data-lake-id="uf19bef10" id="uf19bef10">提出一种新的训练后量化方法 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u69d7a4b7" id="u69d7a4b7">FLATQUANT</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u573b7695" id="u573b7695">。该方法针对每一个线性层优化快速且可学习的仿射变换，并能够有效提升 LLM 权重和激活分布的平坦性 </span></li><li fid="u9281e33d" data-lake-id="ue71bc039" id="ue71bc039"><span data-lake-id="ud639428f" id="ud639428f">该方法首次在 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5bb18f9b" id="u5bb18f9b">LLaMA-3-70B</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u159278a7" id="u159278a7"> 模型上，仅采用简单的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue2216632" id="ue2216632">最近邻舍入（Round-to-Nearest, RTN）W4A4 量化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue854d104" id="ue854d104">，便实现</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u160b34f4" id="u160b34f4">不超过 1% 的精度下降</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2b151346" id="u2b151346"> </span></li><li fid="u9281e33d" data-lake-id="ufab1b2d1" id="ufab1b2d1"><span data-lake-id="u92e07b48" id="u92e07b48">设计一种高效 Kernel，将</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u31eee097" id="u31eee097">仿射变换与量化操作进行融合</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u83c281d9" id="u83c281d9">。在 W4A4 量化设置下，与 FP16 基线相比，该 Kernel 可实现 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b2e7f1f" id="u1b2e7f1f">2.3× 的 Prefill 阶段加速</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7c231877" id="u7c231877">以及 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u210ca8dc" id="u210ca8dc">1.7× 的 Decode 阶段加速</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="PtodS" id="PtodS" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u8737253d" id="u8737253d">🐻</span><span data-lake-id="u0ac9cc15" id="u0ac9cc15"> 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐬 𝐨𝐧 𝐋𝐋𝐌 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u4ef9352e" id="u4ef9352e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud544b518" id="ud544b518">量化是一种常用的模型压缩与推理加速技术，可以有效降低模型大小和推理延迟</span></strong></p><ul list="ub90b1f3d"><li fid="u521f5af0" data-lake-id="u087f8adb" id="u087f8adb"><span data-lake-id="u8ccf65f4" id="u8ccf65f4">对于线性层</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3DXW%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F17ded6ca196d6b6031dc4f1034e628c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NsTQm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c52b8a8" id="u2c52b8a8">，量化可以将全精度权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bm%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe6586a8b19929027da61a4683df1037b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vPiCZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue02ab2e9" id="ue02ab2e9">或激活</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bk%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F43d285f5dc626ccdbbcffcb5f578b38b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PUYW9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6c147cc" id="ue6c147cc">转换为低比特表示，同时也可以选择对 KV Cache 进行量化。例如，b-bit 权重量化可以表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u86b58680" id="u86b58680" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BW%7D%3DQ_b(W)%3Ds%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5CPi_%7B%5C%5COmega(b)%7D(W%2Fs)%2C%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8dfb137549e1c0ad4eba8c3340ad9eb2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h6cwb%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua6085161"><li fid="ua14e1827" data-lake-id="ub7120cac" id="ub7120cac"><span data-lake-id="u27ac6e5c" id="u27ac6e5c">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ifjFZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e62a1b7" id="u6e62a1b7">表示</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7cd3fe68" id="u7cd3fe68">量化步长</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u04638ce4" id="u04638ce4">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPi(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7584df13854ea4f59396c5f64ad2732.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BUsdy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40ad6fea" id="u40ad6fea">表示投影函数，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5COmega(b)%3D%5C%5C%7B0%2C1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C2%5Eb-1%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2b1be320d51c1a9c9168723ef2598eab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VSZxR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u897b0dcc" id="u897b0dcc">表示所有 b-bit 整数点构成的集合</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue2c3b5c2" id="ue2c3b5c2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u03b0f082" id="u03b0f082" style="color: #004347">LLM 的输入激活</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94e79ad0c1aabeafef9e2fc4af6adf66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z9Uzv%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc036fd5f" id="uc036fd5f" style="color: #004347">中通常包含大量离群值。为降低这些离群值对量化的影响，一种常见方法是在权重和激活上进行逐通道缩放</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5b291ebb" id="u5b291ebb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3D%5C%5Cleft(X%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)W%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbd1bc70cb6aff6509b96ab5d1beaf926.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j8Y3g%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ucf30ee63"><li fid="u2534c469" data-lake-id="u9a594890" id="u9a594890"><span data-lake-id="u387c0ffa" id="u387c0ffa">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb536cacb9e3cce4713b0a1955425b129.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jIJve%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u11e813a1" id="u11e813a1">表示逐通道缩放因子。该缩放向量通过同时考虑输入激活与权重的数值幅度，对激活分布进行平滑。对于第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F036441a335dd85c838f76d63a3db2363.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DGy23%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u135ecc0b" id="u135ecc0b">个通道，其缩放因子可以表示为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_j%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmax(%7CX_j%7C%5E%5C%5Calpha)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmax(%7CW_j%7C%5E%7B1-%5C%5Calpha%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff98c1c60112e64333a81b5770d816086.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oTlSL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u243ae1e6" id="u243ae1e6">。经过缩放后的权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)W%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe51b02f07e95cff3c77404491c233482.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PvrYK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7c22be7e" id="u7c22be7e">可以预先与原始权重进行融合，从而避免在运行时额外执行相应的缩放计算</span></li><li fid="u2534c469" data-lake-id="u926a032d" id="u926a032d"><span data-lake-id="u0114d04b" id="u0114d04b">一些方法进一步引入</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9919b03" id="ud9919b03">逐通道平移</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u44ff3ee1" id="u44ff3ee1">，将激活转换为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(X-z)%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4c25f2f0a0fc707b053ca412cac2919b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UjyOJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2f07d086" id="u2f07d086">，以进一步减弱离群值带来的影响。还有方法进一步将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fabe4682edfb0957437aaffa2e880a674.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DYZ51%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u289182c6" id="u289182c6">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02bab26178a0cd05dae15ad487830237.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vQevY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5251c1cc" id="u5251c1cc">均设置为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5bac4d7e" id="u5bac4d7e">可学习参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udaa49245" id="udaa49245">，通过校准数据对其进行优化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf0997ef3" id="uf0997ef3"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubdc999c8" id="ubdc999c8" style="color: #004347">近期研究发现，Hadamard 矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B%2B1%2C-1%5C%5C%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f716b92ade3e183dca08b7e252942df.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tEWqN%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud4602bd6" id="ud4602bd6" style="color: #004347">对于平滑激活中的离群值尤其有效</span></strong></p><ul list="ue58548cb"><li fid="u3eec0800" data-lake-id="ufa2af4ac" id="ufa2af4ac"><span data-lake-id="ua16ea6c2" id="ua16ea6c2">与逐通道缩放不同，从矩阵乘法的角度来看，Per-channel Scaling 本质上仅对变换矩阵的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua9cc70f5" id="ua9cc70f5">对角元素</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6659463b" id="u6659463b">进行调整，因此每个通道仍然主要独立地进行缩放。相比之下，Hadamard 变换会对激活和权重的通道进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf33c0fef" id="uf33c0fef">旋转与混合</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2acbdedb" id="u2acbdedb">，从而将原本集中在少数通道中的离群值重新分布至所有通道，有效降低离群值的影响</span></li><li fid="u3eec0800" data-lake-id="u5611062b" id="u5611062b"><span data-lake-id="u029cbc89" id="u029cbc89">由于 Hadamard 矩阵具有正交性，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5E%5C%5Ctop%20H%3DI%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4476ad8f349c38aaef2447cecbe205f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yrXVc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b4c271b" id="u5b4c271b">，因此原始线性层</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3DXW%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F17ded6ca196d6b6031dc4f1034e628c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eSJDh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1fb00b9" id="ue1fb00b9">可以等价地改写为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3874991b" id="u3874991b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3DXW%5E%5C%5Ctop%3D(XH)(H%5E%5C%5Ctop%20W%5E%5C%5Ctop).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F23e5ffb87466c7b1f65cd1ead73078f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JjaWK%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u284e4bd8"><li fid="u1d4b154a" data-lake-id="u0dc22bea" id="u0dc22bea"><span data-lake-id="u27d38e81" id="u27d38e81">首先对激活执行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22XH%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8cc7eb17676c887f8b126d0bcc5168b1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LipC0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaae22ec2" id="uaae22ec2">变换，同时对权重执行对应的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22WH%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b6492cae7eebbeb4f342b2f98ce764b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zefcV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uff18b132" id="uff18b132">变换，而不会改变线性层最终的计算结果。与逐通道缩放类似，变换后的权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22WH%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b6492cae7eebbeb4f342b2f98ce764b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sP9AV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40a003e0" id="u40a003e0">可以在模型部署之前进行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uee98e84c" id="uee98e84c">离线预处理</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue35324d3" id="ue35324d3">，从而减少 Hadamard 变换在实际推理过程中带来的额外运行时开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ued65fe0c" id="ued65fe0c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u236f0be9" id="u236f0be9" style="color: #DF2A3F">权重与激活的平坦性：在去除离群值之后，分布更加平坦的张量通常更容易进行量化，这类张量通常也具有较低的峰度（Kurtosis）</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u928c2024" id="u928c2024" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1788364076345-2336f47e-668a-42db-9ae1-6e5b88ba1fb8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub8d4f724-956b-406b-8768-6a52f807a51%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubfbe936d-7061-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A940.4000244140625%2C%22height%22%3A264%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A118956%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1328%2C%22originHeight%22%3A373%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22(A)WOFTHE10TRANSFORMER%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A312%2C%22width%22%3A321%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22)XOFTHEL0HTRANSFORMER%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A284%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R(D)XOFTHE30MTRANSFORMER%22%2C%22x%22%3A966%2C%22y%22%3A314%2C%22width%22%3A344%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(C)WOFTHE30HTRANSFORMER%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A329%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYERINLLAMA-3-70B.%22%2C%22x%22%3A701%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A257%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYERINLLAMA-3-70B.%22%2C%22x%22%3A1023%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A263%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAVERINLLAMA-3-8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A340%2C%22width%22%3A261%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAVERINLLAMA-3-8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A371%2C%22y%22%3A341%2C%22width%22%3A244%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ER-CHANNELS%22%2C%22x%22%3A502%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A119%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220020003000%22%2C%22x%22%3A126%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHANNELS%22%2C%22x%22%3A137%2C%22y%22%3A270%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHANNELS%22%2C%22x%22%3A468%2C%22y%22%3A270%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A680%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A113%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220020003000%22%2C%22x%22%3A460%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220040006000%22%2C%22x%22%3A788%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FLATQUANT%22%2C%22x%22%3A955%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220040006000%22%2C%22x%22%3A1120%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A351%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A97%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHANNELS%22%2C%22x%22%3A790%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HADAMAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A766%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1012%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A123%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHANNELS%22%2C%22x%22%3A1126%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORIGINA%22%2C%22x%22%3A323%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A1012%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A116%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SCALINC%22%2C%22x%22%3A595%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226000800%22%2C%22x%22%3A1218%2C%22y%22%3A251%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22400%22%2C%22x%22%3A588%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22400%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f4f4%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u29c4b0e0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue488f4a4"><li fid="u71e271a4" data-lake-id="u553c12fd" id="u553c12fd"><span data-lake-id="ucf746839" id="ucf746839">与原始分布相比，现有预量化变换虽然能够在一定程度上使激活分布更加平坦，但仍存在明显局限。例如，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufa1e7053" id="ufa1e7053">逐通道缩放</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua413b10e" id="ua413b10e">可以有效平坦化激活分布，但其代价是使权重分布的包络更加陡峭。该方法实际上是在权重与激活之间重新分配离群值，而无法同时获得平坦的权重和激活分布</span></li><li fid="u71e271a4" data-lake-id="u416360d4" id="u416360d4"><span data-lake-id="uda1906bc" id="uda1906bc">相比逐通道缩放，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uee08d0f6" id="uee08d0f6">Hadamard 变换</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udd07f22a" id="udd07f22a">能够同时改善权重和激活的平坦性，但在部分情况下仍会产生不理想的数值分布</span></li><li fid="u71e271a4" data-lake-id="u80365800" id="u80365800"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc6b14b32" id="uc6b14b32">FLATQUANT</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2212909e" id="u2212909e"> 能够更加稳定地同时平坦化权重和激活分布，从而为后续低比特量化提供更加有利的数值条件</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u745570fc" id="u745570fc"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub19c5d26" id="ub19c5d26" style="color: #DF2A3F">量化误差景观的平坦性：量化误差在 Transformer 网络中会不可避免地逐层传播，因此，分析不同预量化变换对量化误差传播的影响具有重要意义</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub9c239cb" id="ub9c239cb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1788364041349-a29bfb57-2648-4c7c-930c-a9cdd8493416.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0c2e2f86-5fab-4c0e-ab61-e165e0ac382%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubfbe936d-7061-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A751.7999877929688%2C%22height%22%3A222%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A225104%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1311%2C%22originHeight%22%3A387%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22(BHADAMARDTRANSFROM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A359%2C%22y%22%3A356%2C%22width%22%3A245%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DSTACKEDVIEW.%22%2C%22x%22%3A1063%2C%22y%22%3A355%2C%22width%22%3A166%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C)FLATOUANT%22%2C%22x%22%3A730%2C%22y%22%3A356%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A)PER-CHANNELSCALING%22%2C%22x%22%3A41%2C%22y%22%3A356%2C%22width%22%3A217%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A606%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A155%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ER-CHANNELSCALIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A406%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A166%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FLATQUANT%22%2C%22x%22%3A858%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HADAMARD%22%2C%22x%22%3A669%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OK210012%22%2C%22x%22%3A1056%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A943%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A115%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2220.75100..%22%2C%22x%22%3A699%2C%22y%22%3A295%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O.1210012%22%2C%22x%22%3A383%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A943%2C%22y%22%3A190%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A63%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%22%2C%22x%22%3A285%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A62%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22208%22%2C%22x%22%3A1218%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2233%22%2C%22x%22%3A577%2C%22y%22%3A217%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A89%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOKE1%22%2C%22x%22%3A718%2C%22y%22%3A309%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O.G%22%2C%22x%22%3A279%2C%22y%22%3A208%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A910%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A75%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222550%22%2C%22x%22%3A1036%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2220%22%2C%22x%22%3A883%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OK22100%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2220%22%2C%22x%22%3A551%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222550%22%2C%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A285%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220%22%2C%22x%22%3A277%2C%22y%22%3A229%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2220%E5%85%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A223%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22255%22%2C%22x%22%3A35%2C%22y%22%3A282%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222S%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A163%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A55%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210%22%2C%22x%22%3A1241%2C%22y%22%3A262%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2230%22%2C%22x%22%3A518%2C%22y%22%3A311%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22100125%22%2C%22x%22%3A768%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f3f3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u79f5b786%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="ubfa0bd23"><li fid="u8edaf3ae" data-lake-id="ua9c60118" id="ua9c60118"><span data-lake-id="uea09aa8d" id="uea09aa8d">输入序列前部的 Token 往往会产生非常显著的量化误差。这类 Token 通常被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u68e47825" id="u68e47825">枢轴 Token</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u882f6b76" id="u882f6b76">，其内部往往包含幅度极大的激活离群值。对于这类误差，逐通道缩放和 Hadamard 变换均难以实现有效抑制。相比之下，FLATQUANT 在这些 Pivot Tokens 上表现出显著更低的量化误差</span></li><li fid="u8edaf3ae" data-lake-id="ube2fe81e" id="ube2fe81e"><span data-lake-id="u8162d712" id="u8162d712">其次，量化误差表现出明显的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8a5faa87" id="u8a5faa87">逐层累积</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucda2825a" id="ucda2825a">现象，即随着 Transformer 层数不断加深，量化误差会持续增大；误差沿输入序列维度的增长趋势并不明显</span></li><li fid="u8edaf3ae" data-lake-id="u614d737a" id="u614d737a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u23997bbf" id="u23997bbf">FLATQUANT 对量化误差逐层传播的抑制能力最强，其次是 Hadamard 变换，而逐通道缩放的效果相对最弱</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3f17422a" id="u3f17422a">。这表明，更加平坦的权重与激活分布不仅有利于降低当前层的量化误差，同时还能够有效减缓量化误差在深层 Transformer 网络中的累积与传播</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="Nd4Fq" id="Nd4Fq" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4624618c" id="u4624618c">🦢</span><span data-lake-id="uc3c51b30" id="uc3c51b30"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7cce842e" id="u7cce842e">𝐅𝐚𝐬𝐭 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐋𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐧𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐀𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐧𝐞 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="udc212fbc" id="udc212fbc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0b742873" id="u0b742873">FLATQUANT 的核心目标之一，是为每个待量化的线性层寻找最优的仿射变换。对于线性层</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Y%3DXW%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F17ded6ca196d6b6031dc4f1034e628c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YYzwk%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u426bc3f7" id="u426bc3f7">，可以寻找一个最优的可逆矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%5E*%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe2dc9ed3f89c83ddcf616dd389834559.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hy1Z2%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8607caf7" id="u8607caf7">，使量化后的输出与全精度输出之间的误差最小</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ud1ac8d58" id="ud1ac8d58" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%5E*%3D%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_P%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7CY-Q(XP)Q(P%5E%7B-1%7DW%5E%5C%5Ctop)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_F%5E2.%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff7386730421311ae967f09a4fa7d022f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gb5p9%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4051b444"><li fid="u1b3e98b1" data-lake-id="uec35daeb" id="uec35daeb"><span data-lake-id="ua78eaa5c" id="ua78eaa5c">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%5E%7B-1%7DW%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0ff7790b1d1292810574d9f9d79a9bd5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t6xmH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua87bbc07" id="ua87bbc07">可以在推理之前离线预计算，从而避免在运行时对权重执行额外变换。</span></li><li fid="u1b3e98b1" data-lake-id="ue76d6d03" id="ue76d6d03"><span data-lake-id="u96f94c49" id="u96f94c49">然而，与所有层均可共享同一 Hadamard 矩阵不同，为每个线性层分别维护一个完整的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F449a4ec4507e4580b646b9d5c5bb7a29.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SNAno%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufb367a7b" id="ufb367a7b">具有较高的计算和存储成本。在前向传播过程中，直接使用完整仿射矩阵会使矩阵变换所需的计算量和内存访问量近似翻倍，同时还会使模型额外存储开销接近原模型规模</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc8d0fdf4" id="uc8d0fdf4"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud834f357" id="ud834f357" style="color: #DF2A3F">FLATQUANT 的关键思想是利用两个轻量级矩阵的 Kronecker 积（Kronecker Product），替代规模较大的完整仿射变换矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F449a4ec4507e4580b646b9d5c5bb7a29.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RGYrt%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card></p><ul list="uf455ed26"><li fid="u636a37a2" data-lake-id="uede18360" id="uede18360"><span data-lake-id="u743aead4" id="u743aead4">具体而言，将变换矩阵构造为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%3DP_1%5C%5Cotimes%20P_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47bd4a3e97481303de14be7faa3c456a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RZLvP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u80fd6aca" id="u80fd6aca">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_1%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbccbe0480ae173339a138213b226dd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22znTUn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc76dd7b2" id="uc76dd7b2">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_2%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_2%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3682db55e7e1592b9b982bd0b313be38.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VasdH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8c503255" id="u8c503255">均为规模较小的可逆矩阵，并满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%3Dn_1n_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8b1652ec4ce18d4d949dc68653e886e1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BE7QX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua20da5da" id="ua20da5da">​</span></li><li fid="u636a37a2" data-lake-id="u24eb3acc" id="u24eb3acc"><span data-lake-id="ued9686ae" id="ued9686ae">根据 Kronecker 积的向量化性质，对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa52aad6a2861b98a663630f7795dece6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FNOVF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7506aad" id="ud7506aad">，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bvec%7D(V)(P_1%5C%5Cotimes%20P_2)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bvec%7D(P_1%5E%5C%5Ctop%20V%20P_2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c1f046f3b69dbe052e2ba452958a14c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ezcz2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1931b66c" id="u1931b66c">。因此上式中的矩阵乘法可以进一步改写</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc8eda3fc" id="uc8eda3fc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q(XP)Q(P%5E%7B-1%7DW%5E%5C%5Ctop)%5Cn%3D%5CnQ%5C%5Cleft(P_1%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Ctimes_1%5C%5Ctilde%7BX%7D%5C%5Ctimes_2P_2%5C%5Cright)%5CnQ%5C%5Cleft(P_1%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Ctimes_1%5C%5Ctilde%7BW%7D%5C%5Ctimes_2(P_2%5E%7B-1%7D)%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop%2C%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce41c8ab520467b29422606deb89b1ad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PaUqA%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1477cc7f"><li fid="ua7e0d198" data-lake-id="u99e1766c" id="u99e1766c"><span data-lake-id="ua21007f2" id="ua21007f2">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7BX%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bk%5C%5Ctimes%20n_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe3aa462bbe91b5024c0c16e82a01048e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R0NQE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8cc45f00" id="u8cc45f00">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7BW%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bm%5C%5Ctimes%20n_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F58a5d2ca7e03d634c5bc1ae2eb8bd8da.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cJc1G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9ebb7d6" id="ue9ebb7d6">分别由原始的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94e79ad0c1aabeafef9e2fc4af6adf66.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VeVG5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76b3976f" id="u76b3976f">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22W%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa36915ecf0b5605493f5aeaf1480a9ac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MVgJF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3bfaa8a4" id="u3bfaa8a4">reshape 得到，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctimes_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F491a84f58f887899b4b261b6f0e96ba7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oAkfq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4addf1cb" id="u4addf1cb">表示沿第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OTA9i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a38623a" id="u1a38623a">个轴执行相应的张量-矩阵乘法。完成变换后，权重和激活均会重新转换为二维矩阵，再执行后续矩阵乘法</span></li><li fid="ua7e0d198" data-lake-id="u16f125f5" id="u16f125f5"><span data-lake-id="u452873b1" id="u452873b1">这种设计能够显著降低仿射变换矩阵的存储开销。完整矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffd1905f6d4d60accedfa6b91be93ea9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kdLj8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09ed85f1" id="u09ed85f1">需要存储</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb67c3aca1bcc34aec861fef4fbf09535.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mPjdd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7868cbdc" id="u7868cbdc">个元素，而 Kronecker 分解后仅需要存储</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_1%5E2%2Bn_2%5E2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F679f635fab40769b10a1f173d3ef4045.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RDWDx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2b0699bd" id="u2b0699bd">个元素，其压缩比例满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bn%5E2%7D%7Bn_1%5E2%2Bn_2%5E2%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleq%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bn%5E2%7D%7B2n_1n_2%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bn%7D%7B2%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8779605a1e17a34d25fa54833012d450.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22I2yEk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubcf0bb77" id="ubcf0bb77">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_1%3Dn_2%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7Bn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f735480a6dc994997e527c6ec48308c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Aygex%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f2e819e" id="u0f2e819e">时取等号，因此理论上最多可以将额外存储需求降低约</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%2F2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffa7bcd294cefd4f4fc0363c5eac966e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kGwnr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0c7855e5" id="u0c7855e5">倍。在相同的最优条件下，计算开销最高可以降低约</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csqrt%7Bn%7D%2F2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5dcf1d8a84ce24038a11c67a239a2411.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AXqqv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1c834647" id="u1c834647">倍</span></li><li fid="ua7e0d198" data-lake-id="ue3a55c67" id="ue3a55c67"><span data-lake-id="ub988b2d5" id="ub988b2d5">在实际实现中，作者通过以下方式选择</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F75a79801b1f8d45fdfd7a0b0bbc8d02f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LpjrJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77869fe5" id="u77869fe5">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1b83e2a3d544d2b90cd33a8b662d3039.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22orCVZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce37baac" id="uce37baac">：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(n_1%5E*%2Cn_2%5E*)%3D%5Cn%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7Bn_1%2Cn_2%7D(n_1%2Bn_2)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%20%7D%20n_1n_2%3Dn%2C%5C%5C%3B%20n_1%5C%5Cleq%20n_2.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F049fa7d2ff46e360d8eb45249f087213.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WeohN%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue6764f9b" id="ue6764f9b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7fcb98c7" id="u7fcb98c7">Per-channel Scaling：FLATQUANT 在预量化变换之前显式引入一个可学习的逐通道缩放向量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2ebdb2149528d7025dbef8adf81c7581.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OExcg%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u9c1bf18c"><li fid="uc3a80251" data-lake-id="u3c7835f4" id="u3c7835f4"><span data-lake-id="uf99fb7c2" id="uf99fb7c2">该缩放向量可以成对融合至前一层的 LayerNorm 或线性层参数中，因此不会引入额外的在线推理计算开销。通过这一机制，FLATQUANT 可以首先调整不同通道之间的数值尺度，再利用后续可学习仿射变换进一步重新分布离群值</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2fbeffb4" id="u2fbeffb4"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud75b13f8" id="ud75b13f8">Learnable Clipping Thresholds：为进一步抑制经过上述变换后仍可能残留的离群值，FLATQUANT 针对每个线性层的权重和激活，以及 KV Cache，引入可学习的裁剪阈值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_w%2C%5C%5Calpha_a%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb57056246bd60129779000b0fc00beda.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dHFih%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6d43d32f" id="u6d43d32f">，并通过 Sigmoid 函数约束其取值范围</span></strong></p><ul list="u680e4c36"><li fid="u7cb30a12" data-lake-id="u7b92d277" id="u7b92d277"><span data-lake-id="ud3d0f981" id="ud3d0f981">虽然传统量化方法通常可以通过网格搜索获得较为合理的裁剪阈值，但作者发现，直接通过优化过程</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue260e054" id="ue260e054">学习裁剪阈值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5b219ca2" id="u5b219ca2">能够获得更好的量化效果</span></li><li fid="u7cb30a12" data-lake-id="ud22fbf56" id="ud22fbf56"><span data-lake-id="ud3f3d307" id="ud3f3d307">这些裁剪参数针对不同层分别设置，并可以与线性变换矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffd1905f6d4d60accedfa6b91be93ea9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AH8mJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u02c43396" id="u02c43396">以及逐通道缩放参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(c)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fabe4682edfb0957437aaffa2e880a674.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IHcfF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5bdd8d72" id="u5bdd8d72">进行联合优化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf54d4bd7" id="uf54d4bd7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a767792" id="u9a767792">Training Objective：FLATQUANT 遵循 PTQ 的基本范式，仅使用少量校准数据，例如随机采样的 128 个句子，依次对每个 Transformer Block 进行优化</span></strong></p><ul list="u967033c3"><li fid="u03ed6aa4" data-lake-id="uf0b3059f" id="uf0b3059f"><span data-lake-id="u60f8aaf3" id="u60f8aaf3">对于第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XyGtF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud686d57d" id="ud686d57d">个 Transformer Block，作者通过最小化量化模型输出与全精度模型输出之间的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u62dffe89" id="u62dffe89">均方误差</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u39fc3d80" id="u39fc3d80">来优化该 Block 中的变换参数</span></li><li fid="u03ed6aa4" data-lake-id="u04ab7f93" id="u04ab7f93"><span data-lake-id="ub6b556af" id="ub6b556af">FLATQUANT 并不重新训练整个模型，而是采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7b64f5b6" id="u7b64f5b6">Block-wise Calibration</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1e694adc" id="u1e694adc"> 的方式，逐个 Transformer Block 优化其中的仿射变换矩阵、逐通道缩放系数以及可学习裁剪阈值，从而在较低训练成本下减小量化引入的局部误差及其后续的逐层传播</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u43dca9af" id="u43dca9af" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1788365215266-264a1436-ecab-47e3-bda7-c000326602dc.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3e4df14c-a1f9-4226-8917-2d9ed9e9dcc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u22f3aeee-c6af-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A947%2C%22height%22%3A318%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A140761%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1215%2C%22originHeight%22%3A408%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PAIR-WISEYMERGEDSCALINGVECTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A155%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A284%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUANTIZATIONDEQUANTIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A141%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A261%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MERGEDWEIGHTQUANTIZED%22%2C%22x%22%3A159%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A227%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3AAFINETRANSFORMATIONMATRIX%22%2C%22x%22%3A105%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A258%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEED-FORWARDNETWORK%22%2C%22x%22%3A992%2C%22y%22%3A372%2C%22width%22%3A194%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A733%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A14%2C%22height%22%3A100%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RE-DISTRIBUTE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1009%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINEARLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A1094%2C%22y%22%3A174%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SELF-ATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A539%2C%22y%22%3A372%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A125%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A947%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%2FDIAG(CER%22%2C%22x%22%3A949%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E-DISTRIBUTE%22%2C%22x%22%3A635%2C%22y%22%3A145%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IAG(CEUXN2XM%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22)CR1X72XK%22%2C%22x%22%3A1021%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A259%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A77%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KVCACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A361%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A495%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A11%2C%22height%22%3A67%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A620%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A13%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A861%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22x%22%3A819%2C%22y%22%3A256%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22x%22%3A480%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E%22%2C%22x%22%3A617%2C%22y%22%3A231%2C%22width%22%3A12%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A281%2C%22y%22%3A256%2C%22width%22%3A12%2C%22height%22%3A50%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22D%22%2C%22x%22%3A777%2C%22y%22%3A265%2C%22width%22%3A11%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A220%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22x%22%3A817%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23898477%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u001749a3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="i6ITq" id="i6ITq" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u747784c2" id="u747784c2">🐟</span><span data-lake-id="uae916a62" id="uae916a62"> 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐞𝐫 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ucc534298" id="ucc534298"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a43b07b" id="u9a43b07b">在 Self-Attention 模块中，FLATQUANT 引入四个变换矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7BP_a%2CP_o%2CP_h%2CP_v%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d19353c7d1f2c377e917091ebc5558b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XTZ46%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucebd3b07" id="ucebd3b07">。其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38b0ebcc3cd17845a7fd86182b093d51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EQvrl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud32b6a7d" id="ud32b6a7d">用于平坦化 Query、Key 和 Value 投影之前的输入激活，而</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_o%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29b40494db4fc7948b92fce2bbcff2fd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g4GIr%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6fb5bf92" id="u6fb5bf92">用于平坦化 Output Projection 的输入激活。</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff58a7d88d361ee77b06fbbbc487f18ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AhtdC%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub9b1a367" id="ub9b1a367">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9e97ec97dfd7fb548c494f32c2c79c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sZawt%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u96349d7b" id="u96349d7b">则分别以 Head 为单位，对 Key Cache 和 Value Cache 进行变换</span></strong></p><ul list="uc7454789"><li fid="u3368a72d" data-lake-id="u61f206a8" id="u61f206a8"><span data-lake-id="ue05bd642" id="ue05bd642">FLATQUANT 仅对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38b0ebcc3cd17845a7fd86182b093d51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h7WVI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub472464d" id="ub472464d">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_o%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29b40494db4fc7948b92fce2bbcff2fd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eW0mJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udf55bde6" id="udf55bde6">采用前文介绍的 Kronecker 分解，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff58a7d88d361ee77b06fbbbc487f18ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22So2tG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9cb9886" id="ue9cb9886">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9e97ec97dfd7fb548c494f32c2c79c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JzePA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u99be4ab7" id="u99be4ab7">保持完整矩阵形式</span></li><li fid="u3368a72d" data-lake-id="u15da90b3" id="u15da90b3"><span data-lake-id="u1d26f2c7" id="u1d26f2c7">KV Cache 通常采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud36e12d8" id="ud36e12d8">Per-head Quantization</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6fd51e4c" id="u6fd51e4c">，而单个 Attention Head 的维度远小于完整 Hidden Size，因此直接进行矩阵变换所产生的计算和存储开销已经较低，无需进一步进行 Kronecker 分解。为进一步降低运行时开销，作者将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_o%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F29b40494db4fc7948b92fce2bbcff2fd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xb07P%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3665d92" id="uf3665d92">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe9e97ec97dfd7fb548c494f32c2c79c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eVTp6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u62c485a9" id="u62c485a9">进行融合</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufe2fdc69" id="ufe2fdc69"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0855db54" id="u0855db54">对于前馈网络，FLATQUANT 使用两个变换矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Bug%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fefc055552ffa700aaa61e749f568e934.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JwKRG%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u99f8edc9" id="u99f8edc9">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa90ba0dc247ccb9572763a891c1f2f4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22urppk%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufe1cf850"><li fid="ufa0ea75e" data-lake-id="u499ee004" id="u499ee004"><span data-lake-id="uf3a04a16" id="uf3a04a16">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Bug%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fefc055552ffa700aaa61e749f568e934.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V4Ndr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u19bc88d2" id="u19bc88d2">用于平坦化 LayerNorm 之后、进入 FFN 的输入激活；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa90ba0dc247ccb9572763a891c1f2f4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QbptO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uea2808ac" id="uea2808ac">则用于平坦化 Down Projection 层的输入激活。为尽可能降低推理开销，这两个变换矩阵均采用 Kronecker 分解。此外</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa90ba0dc247ccb9572763a891c1f2f4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QJacL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7997aa95" id="u7997aa95">对应的逐通道缩放参数可以进一步融合至 Up Projection 层的权重中，因此不会引入额外的在线计算开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u094fda27" id="u094fda27"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5de7cc48" id="u5de7cc48">已有旋转量化方法通常利用 RMSNorm 的结构特性，将正交变换融合至前序网络层，从而减少额外的推理计算</span></strong></p><ul list="ue73648ce"><li fid="ub3fab4e5" data-lake-id="u9508b09d" id="u9508b09d"><span data-lake-id="u175d27a3" id="u175d27a3">在采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u67405e13" id="u67405e13">Pre-Norm</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4bf02319" id="u4bf02319"> 结构的 Transformer 中，由于存在 Residual Connection，如果直接将这类变换融合至 RMSNorm 前后的计算路径中，会使不同 Transformer Block 受到残差连接的约束，从而不得不共享相同的变换矩阵，限制不同层分别学习最优变换的能力</span></li><li fid="ub3fab4e5" data-lake-id="u381760e6" id="u381760e6"><span data-lake-id="u8e6d1186" id="u8e6d1186">FLATQUANT 保留原有的 LayerNorm，并允许不同线性层在 LayerNorm 之后分别使用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u17fa4ce4" id="u17fa4ce4">快速且可学习的仿射变换</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubaf14fae" id="ubaf14fae"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaeb419de" id="uaeb419de">作者进一步为 FLATQUANT 设计高效 Kernel，将仿射变换与量化操作融合至单个 Kernel 中</span></strong></p><ul list="u16dfc830"><li fid="u8c424e4d" data-lake-id="u77897787" id="u77897787"><span data-lake-id="uf193b610" id="uf193b610">首先，由于 FLATQUANT 使用两个轻量级矩阵的 Kronecker Product，因此变换</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_1%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Ctimes_1%5C%5Ctilde%7BX%7D%5C%5Ctimes_2P_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd25401fa269135581226d691b4304a37.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zCwpW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d5fe1f2" id="u5d5fe1f2">的计算强度较低，使得该操作无论在 Prefill 阶段还是 Decode 阶段都主要表现为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6622cc6e" id="u6622cc6e">Memory-bound</span></strong></li><li fid="u8c424e4d" data-lake-id="u0fbf1fca" id="u0fbf1fca"><span data-lake-id="ue9c5b18e" id="ue9c5b18e">其次，量化操作本身同样属于典型的 Memory-bound 操作。如果分别执行仿射变换和量化，就需要反复将中间结果写入和读取 Global Memory，从而产生额外的内存访问与 Kernel Launch 开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufad20cb4" id="ufad20cb4"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub1c2e28c" id="ub1c2e28c">为解决这一问题，作者基于 OpenAI Triton，将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%5C%5Cleft(P_1%5E%5C%5Ctop%5C%5Ctimes_1%5C%5Ctilde%7BX%7D%5C%5Ctimes_2P_2%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0aa16b29d714327c64fa75fff5b2988c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UX3LP%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f69fcf9" id="u8f69fcf9">整体融合为一个 Kernel</span></strong></p><ul list="u16dfc830" start="3"><li fid="u8c424e4d" data-lake-id="u74939caa" id="u74939caa"><span data-lake-id="u3b75a493" id="u3b75a493">Kernel 首先将完整的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_1%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbccbe0480ae173339a138213b226dd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MiYJO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a07e8fc" id="u4a07e8fc">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_2%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_2%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3682db55e7e1592b9b982bd0b313be38.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ENq7h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd28a1c8" id="udd28a1c8">加载至片上 SRAM。随后，每个 Thread Block 从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7BX%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95edf82eb8cc264732c442b7e9d89ad5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gybCM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u07388bb5" id="u07388bb5">中切分出一个大小为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7BX%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_1%5C%5Ctimes%20n_2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F755d86ec1f752247aed3100d0f9590d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aL55h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d53a200" id="u7d53a200">的 Tile，并直接计算矩阵变换</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_1%5C%5Cbar%7BX%7DP_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff128468be8bd3e5b425ea4bec8cc5280.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FLJC4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u34ae730d" id="u34ae730d">，随后立即对计算结果执行量化</span></li><li fid="u8c424e4d" data-lake-id="u908208e7" id="u908208e7"><span data-lake-id="u39351a40" id="u39351a40">在整个计算过程中，中间结果始终保存在 SRAM 中，只有最终量化后的结果才会写回 Global Memory。因此，该融合设计避免仿射变换中间结果反复写入和读取 Global Memory 所产生的冗余内存访问，同时减少额外的 Kernel Launch 开销，从而显著降低 FLATQUANT 在线变换的实际推理成本</span></li><li fid="u8c424e4d" data-lake-id="u73d34d26" id="u73d34d26"><span data-lake-id="u0c790055" id="u0c790055">在获得量化后的输出之后，FLATQUANT 进一步采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="udc012cb6" id="udc012cb6">CUTLASS Kernel</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue4dfcde4" id="ue4dfcde4"> 执行 INT4 矩阵乘法，并使用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u25144859" id="u25144859">FlashInfer</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ude3518a2" id="ude3518a2"> 完成 KV Cache 量化</span></li></ul>